1
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:25,119
Look here! If you don't
release my daughter and...

2
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:29,919
You are not in a position demand
anything or threaten us, Osman.

3
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:35,639
Osman, you had better listen to Commander Lucas.

4
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:39,959
After all, the one at the end of my dagger...

5
00:02:41,160 --> 00:02:44,479
...is someone precious you wouldn't...

6
00:02:44,760 --> 00:02:46,679
...want to lose.

7
00:02:49,160 --> 00:02:52,759
A guest of Commander bucas...

8
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:56,159
...martyred both our spies and Baysungur.

9
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,599
I don't know her name.

10
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:02,719
No one knows her name.
All I know is it's a woman.

11
00:03:03,720 --> 00:03:05,119
That woman..

12
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:09,319
The woman Ilbay mentioned.

13
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:15,159
Damn dogs!

14
00:03:17,320 --> 00:03:18,839
Osman Bey.

15
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:23,879
What are we going to do now Osman Bey?

16
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:27,119
What do you want?

17
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:29,039
We will talk Osman.

18
00:03:29,440 --> 00:03:31,319
We will talk.

19
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:33,559
Be patient Osman.

20
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:37,239
We will bargain for your loved ones.

21
00:03:48,720 --> 00:03:50,319
Who are you?

22
00:03:57,920 --> 00:04:01,919
Couldn't we find any trace of the
soldiers that were guarding Fatma?

23
00:04:02,320 --> 00:04:04,559
Did they kidnap them too?

24
00:04:04,760 --> 00:04:06,719
I don't know Holofira.

25
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:32,679
They are here.

26
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:35,879
They are here! They killed them.

27
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:37,999
They killed them

28
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:53,439
Gulce, Kismet.

29
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:57,439
Take their bodies secretly.

30
00:04:57,880 --> 00:05:00,079
Take them to the tribe.

31
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:05,999
Fatma...

32
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:09,279
Oh Allah, protect Fatma.

33
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:16,759
Hazal Hatun, wait.

34
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:21,199
They are demons!

35
00:05:21,440 --> 00:05:23,279
-They are demons!
-Hazal Hatun.

36
00:05:23,280 --> 00:05:25,119
What are they doing to Saruca?

37
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:28,439
Oh Allah, they are so young.

38
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,119
Hazal Hatun!

39
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:32,319
Yusuf, Fatma

40
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:35,759
Hazal Hatun, be quiet.

41
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,999
We shouldn't let the people notice.

42
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:39,959
My heart is on fire.

43
00:05:40,080 --> 00:05:42,319
How can I cope with it?

44
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:44,079
Hazal Hatun!

45
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:46,359
I understand your pain.

46
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:50,559
But if people hear that Osman
Bey's child is kidnapped...

47
00:05:50,960 --> 00:05:54,479
...people could think that there
is weakness within the state.

48
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:57,599
Stay strong, please.

49
00:05:58,800 --> 00:06:00,239
Sisters.

50
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:03,479
Take Hazal Hatun somewhere calm.

51
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:06,479
Come on.

52
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:18,279
Fatma, hold on my girl, nothing bad will happen.

53
00:06:18,400 --> 00:06:19,039
Hold on.

54
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:20,839
Come closer Osman.

55
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:22,079
Come closer.

56
00:06:22,640 --> 00:06:25,959
This might be the last
time you see your elaughter.

57
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:30,919
In any attempt...

58
00:06:32,320 --> 00:06:35,319
...they will die.

59
00:06:37,880 --> 00:06:39,759
Who are you?

60
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:42,199
Who are you?

61
00:06:42,200 --> 00:06:47,199
She is the most ruthless
enemy of the Turks I know.

62
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:52,999
My good friend.

63
00:06:53,480 --> 00:06:55,879
She is here to add her power to mine.

64
00:06:55,880 --> 00:06:57,879
Also...

65
00:06:58,720 --> 00:07:00,719
...I am the one...

66
00:07:01,200 --> 00:07:06,439
...that sent you the box filled
with the fingers of your spies.

67
00:07:08,560 --> 00:07:11,719
Dogs! Damn dastards!

68
00:07:13,080 --> 00:07:15,679
So, you're the dastard I'm going to kill.

69
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:20,599
Take of your mask.

70
00:07:20,840 --> 00:07:24,559
You can only see my face if you kill me.

71
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:25,759
When I take your corpse...

72
00:07:26,760 --> 00:07:28,959
....and show it to the whole world...

73
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:31,759
...then everyone will'see your face.

74
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:33,839
Now tell me what you want.

75
00:07:33,840 --> 00:07:35,119
Now tell me what you want.

76
00:07:36,280 --> 00:07:37,439
What's the condition?

77
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:43,199
...want you to call off the siege.

78
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:46,119
Or your daughter Fatma and the young Beys...

79
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:47,799
...will die.

80
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:53,639
Father. Father!

81
00:07:54,440 --> 00:07:56,999
I am willing to die here.

82
00:07:57,120 --> 00:08:02,599
Don't you ever give up on the
conquest just to save me. Don't do it!

83
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:07,879
I'll die too Osman Bey!

84
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:11,439
I'll die too, my Bey!

85
00:08:16,520 --> 00:08:18,199
Let's say I stopped the siege...

86
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:22,559
...will you give them to me?

87
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:31,319
Is this the only thing we'll
take from Osman, Lucas?

88
00:08:31,880 --> 00:08:33,399
Of course not.

89
00:08:33,760 --> 00:08:37,158
If I had a child...

90
00:08:37,679 --> 00:08:40,279
...I'd give up the world for her.

91
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:44,198
Let's see, if Osman Bey...

92
00:08:45,520 --> 00:08:48,839
...is willing to give up everything for her.

93
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:04,679
Karesioglu Beyhood

94
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:07,039
My Beys.

95
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:10,599
We have been patient....

96
00:09:11,080 --> 00:09:13,959
...and tolerated Osman's uprisings.

97
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:18,559
We didn't want his soldiers to perish.

98
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:20,839
Yes, but now...

99
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:24,359
...all we saw in return were mistakes.

100
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:27,799
Let's punish him my Bey.

101
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:30,639
We will

102
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:33,439
We will.

103
00:09:34,680 --> 00:09:37,399
A state doesn't get
power from its size.

104
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:41,679
The power comes from the
punishment it gives to rebels.

105
00:09:47,880 --> 00:09:50,279
We'll make their heads bow...

106
00:09:50,760 --> 00:09:53,319
...and knees fall to the ground.

107
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:55,319
This is my order!

108
00:09:55,720 --> 00:09:59,119
My army will be ready.

109
00:09:59,520 --> 00:10:02,479
Now it's time for war.

110
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:04,479
As you wish my Bey.

111
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:06,439
May I come in my Bey?

112
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,639
Come in Sancar.

113
00:10:15,560 --> 00:10:17,359
Lucas and the Hatun.

114
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:20,559
They took Osman Bey's girl Fatma Hatun.

115
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:27,359
Beys wait for my command.

116
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:29,639
You may leave now.

117
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:35,839
Sancar.

118
00:10:36,640 --> 00:10:38,559
What are you saying?

119
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:41,159
How did it happen?

120
00:10:41,640 --> 00:10:43,879
They say the Hatun with Lucas did it.

121
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:47,879
She took Fatma Hatun,
Begum Hatun's brother Yusuf...

122
00:10:48,160 --> 00:10:50,319
...and Bayhan Bey's son Saruca.

123
00:10:51,560 --> 00:10:54,439
Is that so?

124
00:10:55,040 --> 00:10:58,119
The Hatun's a sneaky one.

125
00:10:59,040 --> 00:11:02,879
Whoever the Hatun is, she
beat Osman Bey without a fight.

126
00:11:03,680 --> 00:11:05,599
Osman.

127
00:11:06,520 --> 00:11:10,039
Your arrogance caused this.

128
00:11:11,400 --> 00:11:14,439
If he'd listened to me...

129
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:18,279
...now I'd be with Osman, Sancar.

130
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:23,399
I'd do something about Lucas' game.

131
00:11:24,640 --> 00:11:26,559
What will you do now my Bey?

132
00:11:29,040 --> 00:11:31,969
You must avoid interacting with a wolf.

133
00:11:31,969 --> 00:11:35,919
But if you have to, you must not
leave it just injured.

134
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:41,559
An injured wolf would come back to kill, Sancar.

135
00:11:41,960 --> 00:11:45,599
Now it's time to take out the wolf.

136
00:11:45,920 --> 00:11:48,799
Time to take out Osman.

137
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:56,239
I think Lucas is right Osman.

138
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:58,079
He's right.

139
00:11:58,600 --> 00:12:02,839
You're a father who'd give
up the world for her daughter.

140
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:07,039
What's your condition?

141
00:12:08,400 --> 00:12:10,079
What is it?

142
00:12:10,160 --> 00:12:14,999
Lifting the siege is enough
for you to have the Beys but...

143
00:12:21,440 --> 00:12:24,279
Your daughter, Fatma...

144
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:29,839
She is a piece of your heart, Osman.

145
00:12:29,840 --> 00:12:31,919
For her...

146
00:12:31,920 --> 00:12:35,239
Would you give a piece of your nation's heart...

147
00:12:35,240 --> 00:12:37,359
...Sogut...

148
00:12:41,400 --> 00:12:44,279
Can you give up on it for her?

149
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:52,079
Who are you? Who are you to
ask for a piece of my nation's land.

150
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:55,119
You lowlife dogs.

151
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:58,359
Do you see it Lucas?

152
00:12:58,360 --> 00:13:01,599
He got so mad.

153
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:03,559
Father.

154
00:13:03,560 --> 00:13:07,159
Don't yield to these devils, don't.

155
00:13:07,160 --> 00:13:11,959
Your daughter is running towards
death, Osman. Don't listen to her.

156
00:13:13,040 --> 00:13:18,719
You will clear Sogut of
your soldiers and folk...

157
00:13:18,720 --> 00:13:21,559
...and surrender it to us.

158
00:13:21,560 --> 00:13:23,679
Your people...

159
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:28,999
You will get them at the city square tomorrow.

160
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:31,439
You lowlife dog...

161
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:33,279
You'll pay for this.

162
00:13:33,280 --> 00:13:35,119
We would've loved to stay here...

163
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:37,679
...and listen to you Osman...

164
00:13:37,680 --> 00:13:39,639
...but we're very busy.

165
00:13:39,640 --> 00:13:41,399
Don't forget it.

166
00:13:41,400 --> 00:13:42,919
Tomorrow.

167
00:13:42,920 --> 00:13:44,839
At the Sogut city square.

168
00:13:44,840 --> 00:13:46,679
Don't forget.

169
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:53,599
You lowlife...

170
00:14:00,280 --> 00:14:03,959
I'll have the upper hand on you one day.

171
00:14:05,600 --> 00:14:07,519
Fatma.

172
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:22,519
You will regret this.

173
00:14:24,720 --> 00:14:25,479
Daughter...

174
00:14:25,480 --> 00:14:27,479
Mother.

175
00:14:32,800 --> 00:14:35,919
You lowlives...

176
00:14:52,080 --> 00:14:54,719
Let me go.

177
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:01,799
I've told you Lucas.

178
00:15:01,800 --> 00:15:04,399
I've told you that I will
sever Osman's lifeline.

179
00:15:04,400 --> 00:15:08,519
He's just losing blood for
now but when he loses Sogut...

180
00:15:08,520 --> 00:15:10,639
...then he'll be destroyed completely.

181
00:15:10,640 --> 00:15:12,199
Devil.

182
00:15:12,200 --> 00:15:15,079
Devil, do you think Osman bey
will let you get away with this?

183
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:21,239
Let me go.

184
00:15:22,480 --> 00:15:23,879
Let go.

185
00:15:23,880 --> 00:15:27,399
You'll die.

186
00:15:29,520 --> 00:15:31,319
Let go.

187
00:15:46,920 --> 00:15:51,519
Let go. Let him go. Let go.

188
00:15:53,640 --> 00:15:58,039
Your life depends on what
comes out of our mouths.

189
00:15:59,200 --> 00:16:04,959
Where is Osman Bey now? Where is he?

190
00:16:09,520 --> 00:16:14,639
Whose feet are you under?

191
00:16:23,680 --> 00:16:25,599
Let go.

192
00:16:32,640 --> 00:16:35,359
Let go. Don't do it.

193
00:16:52,800 --> 00:16:56,319
-Know your limits, you dog!
-Let go. Let him go.

194
00:16:56,640 --> 00:16:59,999
Let go.

195
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:02,879
You're not the son of a bey anymore.

196
00:17:02,880 --> 00:17:07,719
Right now, you're just a captive.

197
00:17:16,520 --> 00:17:19,637
Soldiers! Take him to the dungeon

198
00:17:24,319 --> 00:17:28,319
Don't... touch... her..

199
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:30,959
Stop!

200
00:17:32,320 --> 00:17:34,239
Don't take the girl

201
00:17:38,160 --> 00:17:40,719
I have better plans for her.

202
00:17:40,760 --> 00:17:44,039
Do you think Osman is going to give
up on Sogut in return of his daughter?

203
00:17:44,080 --> 00:17:45,999
It is Kayi's most precious land.

204
00:17:46,080 --> 00:17:50,279
He has no other option but it
won't be in return of his daughter.

205
00:17:50,360 --> 00:17:53,879
He will never get
his daughter from me!

206
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:23,199
Come on, brother!

207
00:18:33,840 --> 00:18:37,199
Drink. Drink. It's quite chilly.

208
00:18:39,320 --> 00:18:42,559
You'll feel much better, my brothers!

209
00:18:50,120 --> 00:18:51,799
Osman.

210
00:18:52,720 --> 00:18:54,799
Osman, stop.

211
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:00,319
Osman.

212
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:05,159
My Osman.

213
00:19:09,400 --> 00:19:11,679
Stop, my Bey! Stop

214
00:19:12,040 --> 00:19:14,159
My Bey, stop

215
00:19:14,200 --> 00:19:15,839
How can I stop?

216
00:19:16,720 --> 00:19:19,119
How can I stop, my Bala, huh?

217
00:19:20,160 --> 00:19:21,599
How can I stop?

218
00:19:22,280 --> 00:19:26,719
I left my daughter Fatma
in that infidel's hands.

219
00:19:26,840 --> 00:19:28,839
How can I wait?

220
00:19:34,200 --> 00:19:34,919
My Bey.

221
00:19:34,920 --> 00:19:37,639
-I can't control my anger.
-My Bey.

222
00:19:37,880 --> 00:19:40,759
No, I want to
destroy that castle!

223
00:19:41,320 --> 00:19:43,399
I want to burn it to the ground!

224
00:19:43,800 --> 00:19:46,839
My Bey, you are wounded.
We need to stop the bleeding.

225
00:19:47,240 --> 00:19:48,799
Bala, stop.

226
00:19:48,800 --> 00:19:51,319
I don't care about my wound

227
00:19:52,720 --> 00:19:55,719
My daughter is there!

228
00:19:56,360 --> 00:19:57,679
I don't care about my wound

229
00:20:03,600 --> 00:20:08,359
If they touch my daughter, if they harm her...

230
00:20:10,720 --> 00:20:13,239
...I will leave none of them alive!

231
00:20:13,840 --> 00:20:16,359
I will cut them into pieces!

232
00:20:17,560 --> 00:20:21,359
That's all I know!

233
00:20:27,400 --> 00:20:29,719
Are we going to give Sogut to them?

234
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:35,199
My Fatma on one hand.

235
00:20:36,400 --> 00:20:39,679
My blue eyed darling girl.

236
00:20:42,040 --> 00:20:44,119
And on the other hand...

237
00:20:46,160 --> 00:20:50,279
...the lands we established our state, Sogut.

238
00:20:56,320 --> 00:20:57,759
Both of them...

239
00:21:00,720 --> 00:21:03,959
...are entrusted to me by great Allah.

240
00:21:06,680 --> 00:21:08,319
What will we do?

241
00:21:08,720 --> 00:21:11,719
Our daughter is in that woman's hands.

242
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:14,959
What are we going to do?

243
00:21:44,960 --> 00:21:46,919
Who is that demon?

244
00:21:47,120 --> 00:21:48,679
Who is that damned woman?

245
00:21:48,680 --> 00:21:51,839
How could she kidnap our sister?

246
00:21:52,040 --> 00:21:53,919
First our spies...

247
00:21:54,480 --> 00:21:56,319
...then Baysungur.

248
00:21:56,920 --> 00:21:58,559
Now...

249
00:22:00,880 --> 00:22:03,599
...now my sister Fatma!

250
00:22:03,800 --> 00:22:08,159
Whoever that demon is, she knows us well.

251
00:22:09,400 --> 00:22:10,679
Brother...

252
00:22:11,600 --> 00:22:13,759
...who is this person that
holds a grudge against us?

253
00:22:13,760 --> 00:22:16,839
How could she dare to
kidnap our beloved sister!?

254
00:22:17,240 --> 00:22:20,759
My shahzade, they can't
do anything to Fatma Hatun.

255
00:22:21,120 --> 00:22:22,719
Don't worry.

256
00:22:22,720 --> 00:22:25,279
We will go and take her, with the help of Allah.

257
00:22:25,280 --> 00:22:28,279
They can't harm her. If they harm her...

258
00:22:28,600 --> 00:22:32,399
...they know that we would
burn down the whole world.

259
00:22:33,760 --> 00:22:35,719
But we need to make a move.

260
00:22:35,720 --> 00:22:38,039
We will make a move, Aykurt.

261
00:22:38,040 --> 00:22:39,839
Send a pigeon to Ilbay.

262
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:41,839
We will need him.

263
00:22:41,840 --> 00:22:43,359
As you command my Shahzade.

264
00:22:45,960 --> 00:22:47,119
Alaeddin.

265
00:22:47,880 --> 00:22:49,479
Look at me.

266
00:22:50,080 --> 00:22:53,639
It's not the time to be sad or to grieve.

267
00:22:53,640 --> 00:22:56,799
It's time to stand tall and take action.

268
00:22:59,400 --> 00:23:02,759
We will! We will.

269
00:23:03,280 --> 00:23:06,759
We will show them what it means to hurt us!

270
00:23:06,960 --> 00:23:08,319
All of them!

271
00:23:08,320 --> 00:23:10,079
We will, with the help of Allah.

272
00:23:12,800 --> 00:23:16,519
Let go of me! You dastards!

273
00:23:16,680 --> 00:23:20,159
-Act like a man! - If you...

274
00:23:20,200 --> 00:23:24,679
If Fatma Hatun gets hurt...

275
00:23:25,000 --> 00:23:28,679
...I'll make this castle your grave

276
00:23:28,760 --> 00:23:29,839
Dastards!

277
00:23:29,840 --> 00:23:31,639
You damned idiots!

278
00:23:31,640 --> 00:23:33,079
Dogs

279
00:23:33,080 --> 00:23:35,079
Be a man!

280
00:23:37,760 --> 00:23:38,439
Yusuf.

281
00:23:41,560 --> 00:23:43,119
You're strong...

282
00:23:45,600 --> 00:23:46,719
...and I'm smart.

283
00:23:49,040 --> 00:23:49,879
Come on.

284
00:23:51,800 --> 00:23:52,839
Let's work together.

285
00:23:59,680 --> 00:24:01,119
Two Beys from enemy tribes...

286
00:24:02,960 --> 00:24:05,799
...can burn this castle to the ground.

287
00:24:07,320 --> 00:24:10,839
You're a child living in the
shadow of your father, Saruca Bey.

288
00:24:12,240 --> 00:24:13,599
We can't work together.

289
00:24:22,440 --> 00:24:26,399
But if fate wants two enemies to work together..

290
00:24:28,480 --> 00:24:29,919
...then we'll do it.

291
00:24:32,360 --> 00:24:34,679
We'll work together for Fatma Hatun.

292
00:24:35,280 --> 00:24:37,239
We'll save her from here...

293
00:24:37,520 --> 00:24:39,719
...and send these dastards to hell.

294
00:24:39,920 --> 00:24:40,879
Alright.

295
00:24:41,840 --> 00:24:42,839
Alright.

296
00:24:43,360 --> 00:24:44,799
Alright.

297
00:24:50,440 --> 00:24:52,639
Now let's think about how to escape...

298
00:24:54,640 --> 00:24:55,679
...from this cell.

299
00:24:58,560 --> 00:25:01,799
Osman Bey's Base.

300
00:25:06,200 --> 00:25:07,879
What did we do?

301
00:25:09,480 --> 00:25:13,679
How did we leave our
children there and come back?

302
00:25:16,160 --> 00:25:18,719
They want Sogut in return for their lives.

303
00:25:19,880 --> 00:25:21,399
What will we do now?

304
00:25:22,240 --> 00:25:26,279
I don't trust that soulless woman's words.

305
00:25:27,160 --> 00:25:31,039
Even if we do as they say,
their lives are in danger.

306
00:25:32,400 --> 00:25:35,159
Hold on. Get it together all of you.

307
00:25:37,120 --> 00:25:39,159
Infidels have our children.

308
00:25:39,520 --> 00:25:41,759
We can't sit here think bad thoughts.

309
00:25:43,480 --> 00:25:46,719
No. We will not fall down.

310
00:25:48,560 --> 00:25:49,439
Now...

311
00:25:50,880 --> 00:25:54,679
...we must talk about how
to bring back our children.

312
00:25:58,320 --> 00:25:59,759
Tell me.

313
00:26:00,440 --> 00:26:01,519
Bayhan Bey.

314
00:26:02,760 --> 00:26:04,559
How do we get them back...

315
00:26:05,000 --> 00:26:07,239
...without losing anyone?

316
00:26:10,360 --> 00:26:12,719
Begum Hatun's right, my Bey.

317
00:26:14,000 --> 00:26:15,919
Even if we do as they say...

318
00:26:16,640 --> 00:26:20,439
...we don't know if we can save our children.

319
00:26:21,360 --> 00:26:23,439
We need to find another way.

320
00:26:24,280 --> 00:26:26,919
There may be a secret
passage leading to the castle.

321
00:26:28,280 --> 00:26:29,599
Can we save them from there...

322
00:26:30,600 --> 00:26:33,119
...without risking them getting hurt Bayhan Bey?

323
00:26:37,560 --> 00:26:39,159
Tell me Begum Hatun.

324
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:41,519
What should we do?

325
00:26:43,200 --> 00:26:45,679
We shouldn't have lifted the siege my Bey.

326
00:26:47,080 --> 00:26:49,359
Then they would have known...

327
00:26:49,600 --> 00:26:52,519
...we'd attack the castle
if the prisoners are hurt.

328
00:26:53,120 --> 00:26:54,799
While they fought off the siege...

329
00:26:55,280 --> 00:26:57,199
...we'd have done it.

330
00:26:58,160 --> 00:27:00,599
If we had kept the siege...

331
00:27:01,320 --> 00:27:05,279
...they could have killed Yusuf
and Sarucan, and kept Fatma alive.

332
00:27:07,680 --> 00:27:11,159
We aim to save all three of them.

333
00:27:14,000 --> 00:27:15,039
Gencer Bey.

334
00:27:15,840 --> 00:27:18,319
Tell us what we must do.

335
00:27:19,920 --> 00:27:21,199
My bey...

336
00:27:21,200 --> 00:27:22,799
...I say...

337
00:27:22,800 --> 00:27:26,759
...since he's working with those
lowlives and gets along with them...

338
00:27:27,240 --> 00:27:29,599
...then let's go and talk with Karesi Bey.

339
00:27:29,600 --> 00:27:32,079
Let's use him as the middleman.

340
00:27:33,320 --> 00:27:36,119
What are you saying Gencer Bey?

341
00:27:36,120 --> 00:27:39,199
You both say that Karesi Bey works with them...

342
00:27:39,200 --> 00:27:46,399
...and say we should trust Karesi
Bey with those so dear to us, is that so?

343
00:27:55,400 --> 00:27:58,439
I've listened to you all.

344
00:27:59,920 --> 00:28:02,239
I've made my decision.

345
00:28:05,320 --> 00:28:06,999
It's my order.

346
00:28:07,680 --> 00:28:09,719
We're going to empty the city.

347
00:28:09,720 --> 00:28:12,879
We will evacuate the people
and the alps from Sogut.

348
00:28:27,720 --> 00:28:32,439
Osman must be going crazy with
desperation and anger right now.

349
00:28:32,440 --> 00:28:37,279
But he definitely will try
to trick us to save Sogut.

350
00:28:37,280 --> 00:28:39,279
I'm sure of that.

351
00:28:39,720 --> 00:28:43,759
But we won't let him get the chance.

352
00:28:45,040 --> 00:28:48,719
Those stupid boys...Saruca and Yusuf.

353
00:28:48,720 --> 00:28:53,359
One of them is the brother of Begum
Hatun, and the other the son of Bayhan Bey.

354
00:28:53,760 --> 00:28:57,919
While we have both of their most
loved ones here, in our dungeons...

355
00:28:58,440 --> 00:29:01,839
...we can get Osman's secret plan from them.

356
00:29:01,840 --> 00:29:03,959
Good.

357
00:29:04,640 --> 00:29:07,079
Let's get going right away.

358
00:29:07,080 --> 00:29:10,839
Bayhan will talk right
away to save his only son.

359
00:29:10,960 --> 00:29:12,479
He's greedy.

360
00:29:12,480 --> 00:29:15,959
He will betray Osman for
his own benefit right away.

361
00:29:16,240 --> 00:29:21,679
You said Begum Hatun and
Karesi Bey meet up frequently.

362
00:29:22,720 --> 00:29:28,359
When her loyalty for Osman is this fragile...

363
00:29:29,240 --> 00:29:32,439
...why wouldn't she betray him for her brother?

364
00:29:32,680 --> 00:29:35,519
We'll use them both Sofia.

365
00:29:35,521 --> 00:29:37,480
Both of them.

366
00:29:37,480 --> 00:29:40,678
They will give us all
the information we want

367
00:29:40,690 --> 00:29:44,039
about Osman while we
have their loved ones here.

368
00:29:45,160 --> 00:29:48,279
They both must be with Osman right now.

369
00:29:49,040 --> 00:29:54,239
They must be planning at
their headquarters in Akhisar.

370
00:29:55,200 --> 00:29:58,279
Send word right away.

371
00:29:58,840 --> 00:30:00,879
Come with me.

372
00:30:09,120 --> 00:30:11,399
Your meal is ready, ma'am.

373
00:30:11,640 --> 00:30:12,519
Fatma?

374
00:30:12,800 --> 00:30:14,519
She's waiting for you.

375
00:30:17,280 --> 00:30:20,759
They told us to lift the siege and we did.

376
00:30:20,760 --> 00:30:23,359
That's okay. But...

377
00:30:23,360 --> 00:30:27,159
...giving them Sogut...That's
not possible my bey.

378
00:30:27,160 --> 00:30:29,159
Gencer Bey...

379
00:30:32,440 --> 00:30:36,519
How will we control those
who swore loyalty to us if we...

380
00:30:36,520 --> 00:30:39,679
...give the capital of the
nation to the infidels, my bey?

381
00:30:39,680 --> 00:30:44,559
Let's fight. I'll give my life at the
front of the line for our kids but...

382
00:30:44,560 --> 00:30:47,599
...this won't do, it's
against the tradition my bey.

383
00:30:47,600 --> 00:30:49,639
Hold on.

384
00:30:51,320 --> 00:30:53,599
Hold on Gencer Bey.

385
00:30:54,480 --> 00:30:55,919
I've told you...

386
00:30:55,920 --> 00:31:00,039
...to show us a way out. But what did you do?

387
00:31:00,800 --> 00:31:03,799
You talk about Karesi
who works with the infidels.

388
00:31:03,800 --> 00:31:07,999
Like that wasn't enough,
you speak against my word.

389
00:31:08,000 --> 00:31:09,319
My bey...

390
00:31:09,320 --> 00:31:11,959
Enough Gencer Bey, enough.

391
00:31:16,400 --> 00:31:20,439
You continue to defend Mekece.

392
00:31:22,080 --> 00:31:25,879
Go ahead. Go ahead.

393
00:31:41,240 --> 00:31:43,439
What I'm going to say...

394
00:31:44,640 --> 00:31:46,399
..is a secret.

395
00:31:46,480 --> 00:31:49,399
We will take the people
and the alps out of Sogut.

396
00:31:49,520 --> 00:31:51,599
We will evacuate the city.

397
00:31:51,800 --> 00:31:54,919
When that demon woman and Lukas...

398
00:31:55,280 --> 00:31:59,199
...comes the city, the
only thing they will find...

399
00:32:00,000 --> 00:32:02,199
...will be their death.

400
00:32:04,040 --> 00:32:06,479
How is it going to happen, my Bey?

401
00:32:16,880 --> 00:32:19,119
It will happen.

402
00:32:19,240 --> 00:32:21,359
And it will happen in a surprising way.

403
00:32:27,720 --> 00:32:31,079
The enemy came right into our face...

404
00:32:31,240 --> 00:32:33,559
...came inside...

405
00:32:34,080 --> 00:32:37,319
...kidnapped Fatma Hatun from the bazaar...

406
00:32:37,680 --> 00:32:41,679
...killed the sisters, shed our blood...

407
00:32:42,800 --> 00:32:43,959
...and you!

408
00:32:45,640 --> 00:32:48,079
What were you doing, Alps?

409
00:32:49,840 --> 00:32:51,799
Look at my face

410
00:32:52,080 --> 00:32:53,039
Huh?

411
00:32:53,880 --> 00:32:56,479
What were you doing?
Were you sleeping?

412
00:32:56,920 --> 00:33:00,119
Alps were watching everywhere
but we couldn't realize.

413
00:33:00,160 --> 00:33:02,479
You should have realized it!

414
00:33:02,680 --> 00:33:05,679
You should have seen it! You
should have spotted it, Alps!

415
00:33:11,720 --> 00:33:14,799
Go back to your duty, Alps!

416
00:33:15,520 --> 00:33:18,279
Keep your eyes peeled

417
00:33:20,600 --> 00:33:23,319
When the time comes...

418
00:33:23,600 --> 00:33:26,519
...everyone of you will be punished!

419
00:33:26,800 --> 00:33:32,519
But now the bazaar needs
to be protected more than ever.

420
00:33:37,280 --> 00:33:39,679
Right now, Alps!

421
00:33:55,040 --> 00:33:57,799
What do you think you are doing, huh?

422
00:33:58,640 --> 00:34:01,959
You can't even control
the hatuns in your stall...

423
00:34:02,040 --> 00:34:08,319
...but you act as if you were me and
dare to speak after my words, Holofira?

424
00:34:09,040 --> 00:34:11,359
Keep it together, Gonca.

425
00:34:13,719 --> 00:34:19,359
Is it time to be divided? The enemy
infiltrated among us. They took Fatma.

426
00:34:19,440 --> 00:34:22,438
What could we get
by scorning the Alps?

427
00:34:22,520 --> 00:34:24,918
And we should get back to
the tribe as soon as possible.

428
00:34:25,000 --> 00:34:26,478
No.

429
00:34:27,440 --> 00:34:30,759
I know your intention very well, Holofira.

430
00:34:35,080 --> 00:34:37,319
Tell me what my intention is then.

431
00:34:37,480 --> 00:34:41,879
What could my intention be, when
Fatma is in the enemies hands?

432
00:34:42,080 --> 00:34:43,438
Tell me.

433
00:34:46,520 --> 00:34:48,159
Gonca Hatun!

434
00:34:53,000 --> 00:34:55,199
We are ready to set out.

435
00:35:03,000 --> 00:35:05,199
When the time comes...

436
00:35:05,800 --> 00:35:10,279
...everyone's intention
will be revealed, Holofira.

437
00:35:36,240 --> 00:35:41,519
As we spoke, I sent word to our future spies.

438
00:36:17,480 --> 00:36:20,879
Come on, let s have a nice meal.

439
00:36:26,600 --> 00:36:32,279
Do you think I would sit on the
same table as dastards like you?

440
00:36:32,720 --> 00:36:35,359
Sit together with us?

441
00:36:40,680 --> 00:36:44,079
No. You are not here to join us...

442
00:36:44,200 --> 00:36:47,559
..but to serve us.

443
00:36:53,160 --> 00:36:58,359
You Turks would make great servants.

444
00:37:01,440 --> 00:37:05,879
We Turks were not born to be servants...

445
00:37:06,480 --> 00:37:09,919
...nor prisoners!

446
00:37:11,240 --> 00:37:15,679
We were born to be the
executioner of oppressors like you!

447
00:37:16,640 --> 00:37:19,199
Your ancestors know that best!

448
00:37:30,240 --> 00:37:32,839
We will celebrate our victory.

449
00:37:34,640 --> 00:37:36,159
Bring alcohol.

450
00:37:54,960 --> 00:37:57,279
She will serve.

451
00:37:58,880 --> 00:38:01,919
Come on, bring our drinks.

452
00:38:04,760 --> 00:38:06,679
Do as she says!

453
00:38:33,720 --> 00:38:36,039
If you are thirsty...

454
00:38:37,600 --> 00:38:40,159
..you can take a sip.

455
00:39:09,880 --> 00:39:14,079
I could kill you right here!

456
00:39:21,000 --> 00:39:24,079
But I need you alive for a while.

457
00:39:27,120 --> 00:39:33,119
Kill me right now as you have chance!

458
00:39:35,160 --> 00:39:40,079
Or you will regret it terribly!

459
00:39:42,840 --> 00:39:45,679
Are you also bored, Lucas?

460
00:39:52,400 --> 00:39:54,439
Let go!

461
00:39:54,440 --> 00:39:55,799
Take her to the dungeons.

462
00:39:55,800 --> 00:39:58,999
Let go of me!

463
00:40:19,320 --> 00:40:20,719
Yusuf.

464
00:40:22,920 --> 00:40:24,079
Stop that.

465
00:40:24,640 --> 00:40:26,039
It won't open.

466
00:40:26,960 --> 00:40:29,879
At least I'm trying. What are you doing?

467
00:40:32,600 --> 00:40:35,159
We don't know if Fatma Hatun is okay or not.

468
00:40:36,960 --> 00:40:38,839
I'll go crazy if I don't get out.

469
00:40:44,920 --> 00:40:46,639
Tell us is Fatma Hatun okay?

470
00:40:46,640 --> 00:40:49,399
Say something dastards! Is she alright?

471
00:40:55,040 --> 00:40:57,039
-I have a plan.
-What?

472
00:40:59,200 --> 00:41:00,279
I got it.

473
00:41:00,960 --> 00:41:02,039
Hold it. Come on.

474
00:41:04,120 --> 00:41:04,999
Come on.

475
00:41:06,560 --> 00:41:07,679
What is it Saruca?

476
00:41:08,840 --> 00:41:09,849
Come on.

477
00:41:10,200 --> 00:41:11,269
Come on.

478
00:41:14,320 --> 00:41:15,359
My stomach

479
00:41:15,360 --> 00:41:16,479
Saruca what is it?

480
00:41:17,960 --> 00:41:20,799
Yusuf, it worked for my mother before.

481
00:41:20,800 --> 00:41:23,879
When the soldiers come in
to check on me, we'll attack.

482
00:41:27,880 --> 00:41:29,139
Is that it?

483
00:41:29,600 --> 00:41:31,199
Come on

484
00:41:33,520 --> 00:41:34,879
Soldiers!

485
00:41:35,320 --> 00:41:36,679
Call a healer!

486
00:41:36,960 --> 00:41:38,479
Soldiers!

487
00:41:57,360 --> 00:41:58,159
Ilbay.

488
00:41:58,560 --> 00:42:00,359
You'll enter Akhisar Castle.

489
00:42:00,360 --> 00:42:02,359
It won't be easy this time my Bey.

490
00:42:02,920 --> 00:42:04,359
But I'll sneak in for you.

491
00:42:05,840 --> 00:42:07,479
We trust you Ilbay.

492
00:42:07,480 --> 00:42:10,119
You've never failed us until now...

493
00:42:10,480 --> 00:42:13,039
...but this time our children are at risk.

494
00:42:13,360 --> 00:42:14,639
A single mistake...

495
00:42:14,680 --> 00:42:17,359
I'll show them the strength of Kayi Bala Hatun.

496
00:42:17,760 --> 00:42:18,959
Don't you worry.

497
00:42:20,160 --> 00:42:21,879
Get prepared for when you get inside.

498
00:42:22,440 --> 00:42:27,279
Orhan and Alaeddin will come
tomorrow to save Fatma and other Beys.

499
00:42:27,920 --> 00:42:28,799
Alaeddin.

500
00:42:35,760 --> 00:42:38,719
They bring fresh grass for
the horses in Akhisar Castle.

501
00:42:38,880 --> 00:42:40,759
You'll add this to the grass.

502
00:42:40,880 --> 00:42:43,439
Horses will get sick from it.

503
00:42:46,160 --> 00:42:47,039
No.

504
00:42:49,000 --> 00:42:50,999
These are poisonous.

505
00:42:52,440 --> 00:42:54,839
Don't touch them with your bare hands.

506
00:42:57,080 --> 00:42:58,079
Be careful.

507
00:43:00,480 --> 00:43:01,519
Then what do I do?

508
00:43:01,720 --> 00:43:03,999
Then it's the important part.

509
00:43:04,600 --> 00:43:08,239
No one will make a mistake.

510
00:43:08,800 --> 00:43:09,959
Otherwise...

511
00:43:11,040 --> 00:43:13,719
...we'll pay for it with the children's lives.

512
00:43:15,520 --> 00:43:17,039
Now listen closely.

513
00:43:19,160 --> 00:43:20,599
He's in pain.

514
00:43:20,960 --> 00:43:22,359
Let me go!

515
00:43:22,520 --> 00:43:24,319
Walk! Walk!

516
00:43:27,800 --> 00:43:29,359
What's going on here?

517
00:43:29,360 --> 00:43:30,719
Fatma Hatun?

518
00:43:33,320 --> 00:43:34,399
Are you okay?

519
00:43:35,120 --> 00:43:36,439
Fatma Hatun

520
00:43:38,160 --> 00:43:39,399
I'm dying.

521
00:43:40,920 --> 00:43:42,319
What's wrong with Saruca?

522
00:43:46,280 --> 00:43:48,119
He's almost dead.

523
00:43:48,120 --> 00:43:50,999
Take him to a healer. He's the son of a Bey.

524
00:43:51,000 --> 00:43:53,389
Lucas will make you pay for it if he dies.

525
00:43:54,960 --> 00:43:58,039
Come on now!

526
00:44:00,920 --> 00:44:04,559
Come on. Call a healer! Help
him! Don't just stand there.

527
00:44:07,200 --> 00:44:08,759
My stomach

528
00:44:09,520 --> 00:44:11,319
Walk! We're going to see a healer!

529
00:44:22,720 --> 00:44:25,319
Come on.

530
00:44:28,120 --> 00:44:29,799
Stand back! Stand back!

531
00:44:59,000 --> 00:45:01,199
Come on!

532
00:45:01,400 --> 00:45:02,519
Fatma Hatun.

533
00:45:07,880 --> 00:45:08,919
Fatma Hatun

534
00:45:14,600 --> 00:45:15,599
Fatma Hatun

535
00:45:15,920 --> 00:45:17,119
Fatma Hatun.

536
00:45:17,120 --> 00:45:18,039
Are you okay?

537
00:45:18,520 --> 00:45:19,759
I'm okay.

538
00:45:19,960 --> 00:45:21,719
Did that red witch hurt you?

539
00:45:21,840 --> 00:45:24,599
No, she can't do anything to me. Come on.

540
00:45:24,600 --> 00:45:27,087
Come on we're going
to get out of here and ruin

541
00:45:27,087 --> 00:45:29,289
their plans. Come on,
let go of the captives.

542
00:45:29,289 --> 00:45:31,639
Get the swords, brother.

543
00:45:33,480 --> 00:45:35,719
-Come on.
-Save the others.

544
00:45:35,720 --> 00:45:38,119
Saruca, get the swords.

545
00:45:38,120 --> 00:45:40,639
Come on.

546
00:45:44,520 --> 00:45:46,399
The army is withdrawing to the tribe.

547
00:45:46,400 --> 00:45:49,559
Come on, if we're done
let's get moving, come on.

548
00:45:49,560 --> 00:45:51,319
As you wish my bey.

549
00:45:51,320 --> 00:45:53,399
Come on alps.

550
00:45:55,720 --> 00:45:57,319
Begum Hatun.

551
00:46:02,560 --> 00:46:05,199
We're going to save them, you know that right?

552
00:46:05,200 --> 00:46:07,199
I do.

553
00:46:07,200 --> 00:46:09,359
I do Bayhan Bey.

554
00:46:10,840 --> 00:46:14,079
But for the first time, I'm feeling this scared.

555
00:46:15,680 --> 00:46:17,279
Yusuf...

556
00:46:17,360 --> 00:46:18,919
My brother...

557
00:46:18,920 --> 00:46:21,479
Lhave to take care of him.

558
00:46:21,720 --> 00:46:22,799
If something happens to him..

559
00:46:22,800 --> 00:46:24,719
It won't.

560
00:46:26,720 --> 00:46:29,119
We've been enemies for years.

561
00:46:29,280 --> 00:46:33,519
I would've never thought
that we'd be on the same side.

562
00:46:33,720 --> 00:46:35,479
But...

563
00:46:35,480 --> 00:46:37,799
...it's Allah's will.

564
00:46:38,320 --> 00:46:40,119
Now...

565
00:46:40,120 --> 00:46:41,959
...we'll unite...

566
00:46:41,960 --> 00:46:44,919
..and save our loved ones.

567
00:46:44,960 --> 00:46:46,679
God willing.

568
00:47:10,200 --> 00:47:12,599
If you want your son to live...

569
00:47:12,600 --> 00:47:15,319
If you want Yusuf to live
come to the tavern tonight.

570
00:47:15,320 --> 00:47:18,799
Come to the tavern tonight
without telling anyone anything.

571
00:47:18,800 --> 00:47:20,589
Alone.

572
00:47:20,954 --> 00:47:22,124
Alone.

573
00:47:44,120 --> 00:47:47,039
Let's get out of here before
the soldiers come. Come on.

574
00:47:47,040 --> 00:47:48,479
Come on.

575
00:47:50,880 --> 00:47:52,719
Come on.

576
00:47:54,640 --> 00:47:56,239
They're escaping.

577
00:47:58,920 --> 00:48:01,199
-Come on.
-Come on.

578
00:48:11,800 --> 00:48:13,639
Fatma Hatun.

579
00:48:13,800 --> 00:48:15,559
Dead or alive...

580
00:48:15,560 --> 00:48:18,959
You can't escape this hell
without me allowing you.

581
00:48:18,960 --> 00:48:21,879
This hell will be your
grave, you snake.

582
00:48:21,880 --> 00:48:24,119
You Turkish scums.

583
00:48:24,120 --> 00:48:27,399
Do you have these brave
words cursing through your blood?

584
00:48:27,400 --> 00:48:32,519
I can smell the fear you feel deep inside.

585
00:48:32,520 --> 00:48:35,319
From the babes in their cradles...

586
00:48:35,320 --> 00:48:38,599
...to the sisters that are
swinging their swords...

587
00:48:38,600 --> 00:48:42,239
None of the Turks have even a shadow of fear.

588
00:48:42,240 --> 00:48:43,919
You lowlife...

589
00:48:43,920 --> 00:48:46,159
Is that so?

590
00:48:53,120 --> 00:48:56,759
Let's see. Soldiers, don't get involved.

591
00:48:57,280 --> 00:48:57,959
Come.

592
00:48:57,960 --> 00:49:02,759
My sword will be dirtied with your blood.

593
00:49:23,280 --> 00:49:24,999
Is that all you got?

594
00:49:25,000 --> 00:49:26,479
Osman's daughter...

595
00:49:26,480 --> 00:49:28,319
Enough.

596
00:49:33,440 --> 00:49:37,159
Let her go. Fight me you lowlife.

597
00:49:38,000 --> 00:49:40,279
That's enough entertainment.

598
00:49:40,280 --> 00:49:42,479
Don't touch Fatma Hatun.

599
00:49:42,480 --> 00:49:43,959
Don't.

600
00:49:43,960 --> 00:49:47,039
Soldiers, throw them in the dungeon.

601
00:49:47,040 --> 00:49:49,359
Host them well.

602
00:49:49,360 --> 00:49:53,759
Don't let them die but rip out that strange...

603
00:49:54,280 --> 00:49:56,159
...braveness...

604
00:49:56,160 --> 00:49:58,079
..in their heart.

605
00:49:58,520 --> 00:50:00,039
Let go.

606
00:50:00,720 --> 00:50:05,799
Your end will come.

607
00:50:17,560 --> 00:50:19,679
Peace be with you.

608
00:50:20,160 --> 00:50:22,679
Peace be upon you.

609
00:50:23,640 --> 00:50:27,439
What is up? What brings you here?

610
00:50:27,640 --> 00:50:29,999
You are my elder, Karasi Bey.

611
00:50:30,120 --> 00:50:31,759
I came to ask mercy.

612
00:50:31,800 --> 00:50:37,039
If the young knows who his elder is, he
becomes a greater man than his elder.

613
00:50:37,240 --> 00:50:40,839
Tell me. What is the problem?

614
00:50:42,920 --> 00:50:44,919
Osman Bey, my Bey.

615
00:50:45,080 --> 00:50:47,559
He's like a shooting arrow without a target.

616
00:50:47,600 --> 00:50:53,199
He wants to give Sogut to the enemy
because they kidnapped Fatma Hatun.

617
00:50:53,480 --> 00:50:56,199
Unspeakable!

618
00:50:57,120 --> 00:50:58,959
Unseen!

619
00:51:00,800 --> 00:51:07,119
A Turk surrenders his land to the
infidels without using his sword, huh?

620
00:51:07,400 --> 00:51:10,479
We are Beys knowing our customs, my Bey.

621
00:51:10,560 --> 00:51:15,599
We don't disobey our Bey but you
should interfere as our elder, my Bey!

622
00:51:15,720 --> 00:51:18,359
This makes my blood boil!

623
00:51:20,440 --> 00:51:23,119
It won't only make your blood boil.

624
00:51:23,360 --> 00:51:27,879
If it keeps going like this, it will cause
your blood to be shed, Gencer Bey.

625
00:51:28,840 --> 00:51:32,094
If Osman keeps going
like this, he will cause

626
00:51:32,106 --> 00:51:35,799
everyone's end around
him just as he did to himself.

627
00:51:40,680 --> 00:51:43,719
You did the right thing by coming to me.

628
00:51:44,000 --> 00:51:48,679
Don't you worry. I'll go to
Osman and have a word with him.

629
00:51:48,720 --> 00:51:52,039
I'll show him the right way.

630
00:51:52,280 --> 00:51:54,479
You are great, Karasi Bey.

631
00:51:54,760 --> 00:51:57,599
-Thank you.
-Thnka you.

632
00:52:03,480 --> 00:52:06,679
The first leaf has fallen, Sancar.

633
00:52:07,840 --> 00:52:13,319
Osman's plane tree has
started to experience the autumn.

634
00:52:13,720 --> 00:52:16,199
Its fall is imminent.

635
00:53:03,720 --> 00:53:05,319
Come on!

636
00:53:05,440 --> 00:53:09,879
We are going to save Fatma Hatun.
Come on, Ayse! Take your sword.

637
00:53:10,000 --> 00:53:11,719
I got it.

638
00:53:11,880 --> 00:53:15,359
Don't waste your breath. My
father will save Fatma Hatun.

639
00:53:15,480 --> 00:53:18,359
Your father is a stableman!

640
00:53:18,440 --> 00:53:22,319
How is he going to save Fatma
Hatun? And we should go there, too!

641
00:53:22,640 --> 00:53:24,999
Oh but...

642
00:53:25,800 --> 00:53:28,119
...if you are scared, do not come!

643
00:53:28,200 --> 00:53:30,919
Firstly, nothing can scare me!

644
00:53:30,920 --> 00:53:35,119
Secondly, my father is much more than you think!

645
00:53:35,160 --> 00:53:38,999
Your father is a stableman! How can he be more?

646
00:53:39,040 --> 00:53:41,719
My father is a Bey! A Bey!

647
00:53:41,800 --> 00:53:46,119
He has also double sword!
Your father is a stableman!

648
00:53:46,200 --> 00:53:50,879
You know nothing! My
father is not only a stableman!

649
00:53:51,000 --> 00:53:53,079
What is the thing I
don't know? Then, tell me

650
00:53:53,091 --> 00:53:55,319
and let me know what
your father's importance is!

651
00:53:55,440 --> 00:54:00,679
I'll make you regret for what you
said! You'll see who my father is now!

652
00:54:02,600 --> 00:54:05,719
Look at this! My father!

653
00:54:11,400 --> 00:54:12,319
You!

654
00:54:12,480 --> 00:54:15,919
-What were you doing with things in your hands?

655
00:54:17,040 --> 00:54:19,799
Mother! We are going to save Fatma Hatun!

656
00:54:19,880 --> 00:54:23,399
We are going to save Fatma
Hatun! Give me my sword!

657
00:54:23,880 --> 00:54:25,919
You will harm yourselves, kids.

658
00:54:26,520 --> 00:54:30,039
Gazi, don't make me mad or I'll beat you!

659
00:54:30,400 --> 00:54:33,999
Try touching them again

660
00:54:34,520 --> 00:54:36,399
Gonca Hatun!

661
00:54:36,520 --> 00:54:39,439
Tell her something. I can't sit idly.

662
00:54:39,440 --> 00:54:43,159
Gazi, stop. Stop. Your mother is right.

663
00:54:43,160 --> 00:54:45,959
We can do nothing but pray.

664
00:54:55,200 --> 00:54:59,399
Holofira Hatun, if my father
learns I got it, he will get mad.

665
00:54:59,560 --> 00:55:02,159
Let me put it back.

666
00:55:10,680 --> 00:55:12,239
Okay.

667
00:55:15,480 --> 00:55:19,399
Okay, but let's do it together, okay?

668
00:55:20,280 --> 00:55:22,799
I wouldn't want you to get hurt.

669
00:55:24,840 --> 00:55:29,119
Okay then, I'll show you the place.

670
00:55:29,880 --> 00:55:32,119
Okay, come on.

671
00:55:45,160 --> 00:55:46,279
My Bey.

672
00:55:49,640 --> 00:55:53,959
As you commanded, we are gathering the people.

673
00:55:55,040 --> 00:55:59,559
The people will be sad when they
hear that the city will be emptied.

674
00:55:59,800 --> 00:56:02,479
And some will object it.

675
00:56:02,840 --> 00:56:06,759
The people will be convince.

676
00:56:07,520 --> 00:56:09,679
I am doing this for their future.

677
00:56:10,280 --> 00:56:14,359
I can't bring them into this war.

678
00:56:15,520 --> 00:56:16,679
But...

679
00:56:18,120 --> 00:56:21,719
-This time it's different.
-Don't!

680
00:56:23,280 --> 00:56:26,759
We will stand tall and never fall into despair.

681
00:56:28,280 --> 00:56:31,279
We will not give the infidels what they want.

682
00:56:32,440 --> 00:56:36,439
The infidels may have treacherous tactics...

683
00:56:36,800 --> 00:56:39,839
...but we have the swords of The RighteousÃ§

684
00:56:40,680 --> 00:56:44,839
As long as we never stray
from the path of the Righteous...

685
00:56:44,840 --> 00:56:47,679
...we won't be defeated even
the whole world comes after us.

686
00:56:52,960 --> 00:56:55,519
Thank Allah.

687
00:56:56,400 --> 00:56:59,159
We have enough lands to bury them all.

688
00:57:00,840 --> 00:57:02,799
Orhan, Alaeddin.

689
00:57:03,960 --> 00:57:05,839
Now...

690
00:57:07,280 --> 00:57:10,959
...you will tell the people this.

691
00:57:13,200 --> 00:57:14,639
This...

692
00:57:15,360 --> 00:57:17,479
...duty is yours.

693
00:57:23,800 --> 00:57:27,239
-As you command my Bey.
-As you command my Bey.

694
00:57:46,600 --> 00:57:49,879
Kayi Tribe.

695
00:58:04,800 --> 00:58:06,919
The kids aren't here.

696
00:58:10,600 --> 00:58:12,279
Bayhan Bey.

697
00:58:16,200 --> 00:58:18,439
Where is Saruca?

698
00:58:22,840 --> 00:58:25,199
Why didn't you bring my son?

699
00:58:25,200 --> 00:58:28,119
I will explain, hatun.

700
00:58:29,240 --> 00:58:33,719
Why are you alone? Where
are Osman Bey and Mother Bala?

701
00:58:34,760 --> 00:58:36,999
Is Fatma okay?

702
00:58:37,560 --> 00:58:40,159
Tell me you found them, Begum Hatun.

703
00:58:41,640 --> 00:58:45,199
They are asking for Sogut
in exchange of our kids.

704
00:58:50,520 --> 00:58:54,919
Until then, they are prisoners
of the infidels in Akhisar.

705
00:58:56,720 --> 00:58:59,399
Oh Allah, protect them.

706
00:59:02,520 --> 00:59:05,719
Allah! Allah!

707
00:59:08,480 --> 00:59:11,479
Stand strong, hatun.

708
00:59:14,240 --> 00:59:15,839
Saruca.

709
00:59:26,400 --> 00:59:27,639
People!

710
00:59:29,360 --> 00:59:30,359
Sisters!

711
00:59:31,120 --> 00:59:32,479
Brothers!

712
00:59:34,080 --> 00:59:35,959
We've been through bad days...

713
00:59:36,480 --> 00:59:38,679
...and good days, up until today.

714
00:59:39,800 --> 00:59:41,599
There were times...

715
00:59:41,880 --> 00:59:43,839
...we cried and we laughed.

716
00:59:44,600 --> 00:59:46,359
Now I say to you...

717
00:59:47,360 --> 00:59:49,239
...our state is in hardship.

718
00:59:50,160 --> 00:59:51,079
The infidels...

719
00:59:51,640 --> 00:59:53,279
...have our sister Fatma...

720
00:59:55,320 --> 00:59:57,919
...and my Bey's sons.

721
00:59:58,040 --> 01:00:04,519
Allah damn them! Dastards! Killers!

722
01:00:07,200 --> 01:00:10,079
We won't let the get away!

723
01:00:10,080 --> 01:00:12,079
Infidels want something from us.

724
01:00:17,200 --> 01:00:18,839
It will be hard for you.

725
01:00:19,600 --> 01:00:20,239
We know it.

726
01:00:21,880 --> 01:00:25,179
Our decision will hurt you.

727
01:00:27,200 --> 01:00:28,799
It will, but...

728
01:00:37,440 --> 01:00:38,159
But...

729
01:00:42,120 --> 01:00:43,919
...to save our sister Fatma...

730
01:00:44,960 --> 01:00:46,239
..we must do this.

731
01:00:49,760 --> 01:00:51,399
Our land Sogut...

732
01:00:54,680 --> 01:00:56,359
...will be given to Byzantine.

733
01:01:03,280 --> 01:01:07,119
What would we do my Bey? Where will we go?

734
01:01:12,720 --> 01:01:14,439
Isn't there another way?

735
01:01:14,720 --> 01:01:16,959
How can we give up our land for this, Beys?

736
01:01:20,840 --> 01:01:22,599
If there was another way...

737
01:01:23,800 --> 01:01:25,279
...we'd have found it.

738
01:01:26,040 --> 01:01:27,199
But there isn't.

739
01:01:28,080 --> 01:01:29,479
We'll get through this.

740
01:01:29,920 --> 01:01:30,879
Don't worry.

741
01:01:31,360 --> 01:01:34,079
Our tribe will welcome you all.

742
01:01:34,080 --> 01:01:36,719
Don't think we'll kneel before them.

743
01:01:37,440 --> 01:01:40,959
Don't think we'll bow our heads before them.

744
01:01:41,800 --> 01:01:44,119
They cut our beard today.

745
01:01:44,240 --> 01:01:46,159
But I swear to you...

746
01:01:46,160 --> 01:01:48,159
...we'll cut out their hearts...

747
01:01:48,560 --> 01:01:50,999
...like they cut off our beard.

748
01:02:18,280 --> 01:02:20,039
Don't you worry.

749
01:02:22,800 --> 01:02:24,159
Very soon..

750
01:02:24,600 --> 01:02:26,959
...you will be back here.

751
01:02:28,160 --> 01:02:29,039
But...

752
01:02:30,200 --> 01:02:32,559
...those who did this to my people...

753
01:02:33,320 --> 01:02:35,919
...will pay for it.

754
01:02:36,880 --> 01:02:39,439
As Osman Bey, I swear to it.

755
01:03:18,400 --> 01:03:20,199
Peace be with you stableman.

756
01:03:22,720 --> 01:03:24,199
I'm a foreigner.

757
01:03:24,960 --> 01:03:26,399
I want to go to Bursa.

758
01:03:26,960 --> 01:03:28,439
Where should I be heading?

759
01:03:29,400 --> 01:03:31,559
Go towards the sunrise.

760
01:03:31,960 --> 01:03:33,399
You'll find the path.

761
01:03:33,960 --> 01:03:35,079
Thank you, stableman.

762
01:04:00,400 --> 01:04:01,439
Come on.

763
01:04:07,000 --> 01:04:08,759
Go on stableman.

764
01:04:09,560 --> 01:04:11,799
You'll open the gates to the castle for us.

765
01:04:29,320 --> 01:04:31,239
Fatma...

766
01:04:31,400 --> 01:04:33,719
How is she right now?

767
01:04:33,920 --> 01:04:36,879
Do you think she's scared?

768
01:04:38,560 --> 01:04:41,039
Our Fatma wouldn't be scared.

769
01:04:42,880 --> 01:04:44,919
She wouldn't be.

770
01:04:47,000 --> 01:04:49,279
Everyone knows about Sogut.

771
01:04:49,680 --> 01:04:51,639
Holofira, Gonca.

772
01:04:51,640 --> 01:04:54,679
Tell me, how are the people?

773
01:04:54,680 --> 01:04:57,119
Not good, father.

774
01:04:57,760 --> 01:05:00,799
They blame you.

775
01:05:01,320 --> 01:05:06,199
If they knew that you weren't
going to give them Sogut...

776
01:05:11,480 --> 01:05:14,119
Let them blame me for now.

777
01:05:14,120 --> 01:05:16,159
Let them.

778
01:05:16,760 --> 01:05:19,359
But don't forget this.

779
01:05:20,200 --> 01:05:21,799
One person.

780
01:05:22,040 --> 01:05:25,559
Even if one person makes a mistake...

781
01:05:26,400 --> 01:05:29,799
...Fatma and the kids will be in danger.

782
01:05:29,800 --> 01:05:31,959
May Allah forbid.

783
01:05:32,560 --> 01:05:34,319
Lucas...

784
01:05:34,520 --> 01:05:36,639
...and that devil beside him...

785
01:05:36,640 --> 01:05:39,679
They both want to make the
people lose their trust in us.

786
01:05:39,680 --> 01:05:42,839
But they won't be successful.

787
01:05:45,560 --> 01:05:47,919
We're going to get Fatma...

788
01:05:48,120 --> 01:05:50,159
...and Sogut both.

789
01:05:50,720 --> 01:05:52,959
Then...

790
01:05:54,000 --> 01:05:57,279
Then people will understand.

791
01:05:57,880 --> 01:06:01,039
The anger will die down then.

792
01:06:06,360 --> 01:06:08,919
What if they realize our plan, father?

793
01:06:08,920 --> 01:06:10,479
No.

794
01:06:10,480 --> 01:06:12,919
They won't realize it.

795
01:06:16,760 --> 01:06:18,839
We prepared.

796
01:06:18,840 --> 01:06:21,359
With Allah's permission, we will be successful.

797
01:06:21,360 --> 01:06:24,679
-God willing.
-God willing.

798
01:06:27,160 --> 01:06:29,439
Orhan, Alaeddin.

799
01:06:30,360 --> 01:06:33,319
You are to leave the tribe before sunrise.

800
01:06:33,320 --> 01:06:35,079
But...

801
01:06:35,080 --> 01:06:37,239
...don't be seen by anyone.

802
01:06:39,040 --> 01:06:41,759
I don't trust that lowlife Lucas at all.

803
01:06:41,760 --> 01:06:43,199
As you wish father.

804
01:06:43,200 --> 01:06:45,399
As you wish my bey.

805
01:06:56,680 --> 01:06:58,079
Osman

806
01:06:59,680 --> 01:07:02,199
I didn't want them to know but...

807
01:07:02,200 --> 01:07:04,439
...what if they realize our plan?

808
01:07:04,440 --> 01:07:06,439
What will we do then?

809
01:07:08,840 --> 01:07:11,399
We made our plan.

810
01:07:12,320 --> 01:07:14,639
We'll wait now.

811
01:07:24,400 --> 01:07:26,359
Lucas.

812
01:07:31,240 --> 01:07:36,399
Are you going to see which
fish we caught with our net?

813
01:07:41,240 --> 01:07:43,839
You're right Sofia.

814
01:07:44,320 --> 01:07:46,959
Today, Bayhan or Begum...

815
01:07:46,960 --> 01:07:49,519
One of them will be caught by our net.

816
01:07:49,520 --> 01:07:55,439
And they will tell us the plans
Osman made one by one.

817
01:07:55,880 --> 01:07:59,759
Even if they help us...

818
01:07:59,920 --> 01:08:04,599
...both Bayhan and Begum's end
is the same as Osman's, Lucas.

819
01:08:05,800 --> 01:08:08,999
Them, their kids...

820
01:08:09,440 --> 01:08:11,879
...all the Turks...

821
01:08:12,120 --> 01:08:16,519
They will taste death by our hands.

822
01:08:16,520 --> 01:08:18,959
All of them, Sofia.

823
01:08:18,960 --> 01:08:20,359
All of them.

824
01:08:21,160 --> 01:08:23,519
They will lose Sogut first...

825
01:08:23,520 --> 01:08:26,439
...then their lives.

826
01:08:26,760 --> 01:08:28,439
Yes.

827
01:08:40,279 --> 01:08:42,399
Sarucan..

828
01:08:46,319 --> 01:08:48,399
My son..

829
01:08:53,840 --> 01:08:55,319
Son..

830
01:09:00,040 --> 01:09:02,158
Please, bey...

831
01:09:02,160 --> 01:09:04,158
...don't let anything happen to my son.

832
01:09:04,640 --> 01:09:07,999
Please, I'm begging you.
Don't let anything happen to him.

833
01:09:11,840 --> 01:09:14,158
Be strong, hatun.

834
01:09:14,479 --> 01:09:17,959
I understand. It's the heart of a mother.

835
01:09:19,640 --> 01:09:24,158
We'll take him back, hatun. We'll take him back.

836
01:09:27,560 --> 01:09:30,118
How can we trust the infidels, my Bey?

837
01:09:30,640 --> 01:09:32,198
Now...

838
01:09:33,800 --> 01:09:37,399
Who knows what they are doing to my son?

839
01:09:41,760 --> 01:09:45,559
My dear son! My dear son!

840
01:09:48,840 --> 01:09:51,439
My son was taken with a broken heart.

841
01:09:53,000 --> 01:09:57,599
Did he throw himself to the fire
just to prove his worth to you?

842
01:09:57,640 --> 01:10:01,159
Saruca! Saruca!

843
01:10:02,600 --> 01:10:09,479
If you want your son to be alive, come to
the inn without saying anything to anyone.

844
01:10:09,560 --> 01:10:11,479
Alone.

845
01:10:26,160 --> 01:10:28,599
Where are you going, my Bey?

846
01:10:33,440 --> 01:10:35,559
We'll save him.

847
01:10:35,600 --> 01:10:38,239
Wipe away your tears now.

848
01:10:38,920 --> 01:10:43,199
I'll bring him to you one way or another.

849
01:10:44,000 --> 01:10:45,879
Be careful, my Bey.

850
01:10:49,640 --> 01:10:53,439
My Allah! My Allah! Help me!

851
01:10:53,800 --> 01:10:57,879
Protect our children!

852
01:11:05,600 --> 01:11:07,519
Brother.

853
01:11:08,080 --> 01:11:09,799
My mother's...

854
01:11:11,360 --> 01:11:14,079
...and my father's legacy.

855
01:11:16,720 --> 01:11:18,919
I was not only a sister...

856
01:11:19,280 --> 01:11:21,719
...but I was also your mother.

857
01:11:25,280 --> 01:11:27,799
I can't leave you there.

858
01:11:28,800 --> 01:11:31,439
You are left to me from my father.

859
01:11:56,040 --> 01:11:58,439
Leave them! It's enough! Leave them

860
01:11:58,520 --> 01:12:01,759
-Leave them alone!
-We have just started.

861
01:12:02,000 --> 01:12:04,239
Enough! Enough

862
01:12:07,160 --> 01:12:12,999
The price of trying to escape
from my dungeon is heavy.

863
01:12:13,880 --> 01:12:17,079
Leave them! Leave them!
They are the sons of Beys!

864
01:12:17,120 --> 01:12:21,319
Osman Bey will make you
pay for this! He'll make you pay!

865
01:12:21,400 --> 01:12:25,239
The Beyhood is over!
The punishment is over!

866
01:12:25,480 --> 01:12:28,359
There is only torture from now on!

867
01:12:30,480 --> 01:12:33,999
If you don't want to
experience the same thing...

868
01:12:36,280 --> 01:12:38,319
...shut your mouth up.

869
01:12:38,440 --> 01:12:41,759
You have only power over our bodies!

870
01:12:41,800 --> 01:12:46,399
But against our cause you have no power!

871
01:12:46,480 --> 01:12:49,559
When you face Osman Bey...

872
01:12:49,880 --> 01:12:53,119
...what will you do, huh? What will you do?

873
01:12:53,720 --> 01:12:56,399
I pity you so much! So much

874
01:12:58,120 --> 01:13:00,479
-Fatma!
-Fatma Hatun!

875
01:13:00,600 --> 01:13:04,119
Don't touch her! Don't touch her, you rat!

876
01:13:04,600 --> 01:13:10,159
I can crush you like a bug! I can destroy you.

877
01:13:11,360 --> 01:13:16,879
But look! I'm waiting, huh? I'm waiting.

878
01:13:17,440 --> 01:13:23,039
When we take Sogut
tomorrow, I'll also take your life.

879
01:13:23,280 --> 01:13:25,879
Do you understand?

880
01:13:34,760 --> 01:13:35,839
What's going on?

881
01:13:35,880 --> 01:13:39,919
Ma'am, all the horses in the castle
got sick. I guess there is a outbreak.

882
01:13:40,320 --> 01:13:42,439
Then, what are you waiting for?

883
01:13:42,560 --> 01:13:45,439
Bring new horses immediately!

884
01:13:54,080 --> 01:13:55,879
You, cursed ones!

885
01:14:00,720 --> 01:14:03,399
I'll settle the accounts with you tomorrow!

886
01:14:03,440 --> 01:14:04,799
You dog

887
01:14:24,440 --> 01:14:26,199
Welcome.

888
01:14:33,680 --> 01:14:35,279
Bayhan Bey.

889
01:14:41,680 --> 01:14:44,359
It's because we can speak freely.

890
01:14:46,160 --> 01:14:48,599
Where is my son?

891
01:14:48,920 --> 01:14:51,199
Where is Saruca?

892
01:14:51,520 --> 01:14:53,239
He's in good hands.

893
01:14:54,600 --> 01:15:00,199
You told me you were going to give me
my son, when I told you Osman Bey's plan.

894
01:15:01,360 --> 01:15:03,759
That was our deal.

895
01:15:03,880 --> 01:15:06,759
I'll keep my promise.

896
01:15:07,040 --> 01:15:10,399
But if I gave your son right now...

897
01:15:10,880 --> 01:15:14,519
...your treachery would be
revealed quickly, Bayhan Bey.

898
01:15:16,160 --> 01:15:17,479
Tomorrow.

899
01:15:18,400 --> 01:15:20,200
Tomorrow, you'll get your son.

900
01:15:20,560 --> 01:15:21,960
Commander!

901
01:15:21,960 --> 01:15:27,530
I swear on the Holy Bible that nothing
will happen to your son, Bayhan Bey.

902
01:15:27,680 --> 01:15:31,879
You'll take your son back safe and sound.

903
01:15:35,800 --> 01:15:37,519
What about the others?

904
01:15:38,240 --> 01:15:40,159
The others...

905
01:15:41,120 --> 01:15:45,839
Unfortunately, Begum Hatun
wasn't clever as you were.

906
01:15:46,120 --> 01:15:48,879
I also sent her words but she didn't respond.

907
01:15:49,320 --> 01:15:55,239
You were the only clever
one who accepted my offer.

908
01:15:59,280 --> 01:16:03,879
Who can say anything to a
father, who betray his Bey...

909
01:16:06,280 --> 01:16:08,319
...for his son's life?

910
01:16:10,200 --> 01:16:11,759
Now...

911
01:16:13,320 --> 01:16:14,719
I listen to you.

912
01:16:15,280 --> 01:16:19,079
What is Osman's plan?

913
01:16:24,960 --> 01:16:28,159
Osman Bey has evacuated Sogut.

914
01:16:28,840 --> 01:16:34,959
He's going to plant gunpowder
in the every corner of Sogut.

915
01:16:36,160 --> 01:16:40,639
When you come inside,
there will be a big explosion.

916
01:16:41,320 --> 01:16:44,279
That's how he plans to kill you.

917
01:16:47,080 --> 01:16:50,599
You think you are so clever, huh, Osman?

918
01:16:51,120 --> 01:16:53,999
I should have guessed it.

919
01:16:54,440 --> 01:16:56,079
Lukas.

920
01:16:59,080 --> 01:17:04,439
You promised me. You were going to
give my son, when I revealed the secret.

921
01:17:04,520 --> 01:17:07,719
I'll keep my promise, Bayhan Bey.

922
01:17:08,360 --> 01:17:09,799
Goodbye.

923
01:17:22,960 --> 01:17:27,199
Peace and mercy of Allah be upon you.

924
01:17:40,040 --> 01:17:41,719
Oh Allah.

925
01:17:44,320 --> 01:17:46,759
You are the Greatest.

926
01:17:48,280 --> 01:17:50,399
I take shelter in your mercy.

927
01:17:51,880 --> 01:17:54,999
Don't test me with the
pain of losing my brother.

928
01:17:56,240 --> 01:17:58,759
Please bring him back to me.

929
01:18:38,440 --> 01:18:39,599
Fatma.

930
01:18:39,600 --> 01:18:41,199
Welcome father.

931
01:18:41,200 --> 01:18:43,399
Thank you.

932
01:18:43,520 --> 01:18:45,159
Thanks.

933
01:18:45,160 --> 01:18:46,919
I had a table prepared for you.

934
01:18:47,080 --> 01:18:49,799
And I cooked half of the meals.

935
01:18:50,000 --> 01:18:52,399
What did you prepare for your father?

936
01:18:52,400 --> 01:18:54,239
I prepared meat.

937
01:18:58,040 --> 01:19:01,319
And I made kavut as a dessert.

938
01:19:01,640 --> 01:19:03,359
Praise be!

939
01:19:03,360 --> 01:19:05,959
I also cooked Komec.

940
01:19:05,960 --> 01:19:08,879
I like it. My dear.

941
01:19:10,240 --> 01:19:12,159
Thank you.

942
01:19:16,320 --> 01:19:17,879
Fatma..

943
01:19:21,680 --> 01:19:25,719
Oh my blue eyed darling girl.

944
01:19:35,640 --> 01:19:37,239
Fatma.

945
01:19:39,800 --> 01:19:42,079
What if something happened to you?

946
01:19:42,520 --> 01:19:44,959
What if I couldn't see you again?

947
01:19:44,960 --> 01:19:47,319
What would I do then?

948
01:19:47,560 --> 01:19:51,279
Well, you don't see us,
Osman Bey! You see your alps.

949
01:19:51,280 --> 01:19:52,919
You see Iltutan.

950
01:19:52,920 --> 01:19:55,519
You even see your enemies more than us!

951
01:19:55,520 --> 01:19:58,519
You either go to battle,
or get ready for battle.

952
01:19:58,520 --> 01:20:02,599
Do you have to be Osman Bey all
the time? When will you be our father?

953
01:20:04,640 --> 01:20:06,119
Come here.

954
01:20:06,360 --> 01:20:07,799
My Fatma.

955
01:20:07,800 --> 01:20:10,279
When necessary, I am Osman Bey.

956
01:20:11,480 --> 01:20:13,759
When necessary, I am your father.

957
01:20:15,600 --> 01:20:18,479
I want to see my father more.

958
01:20:19,520 --> 01:20:20,759
My dear.

959
01:20:26,520 --> 01:20:28,079
Oh Allah.

960
01:20:30,840 --> 01:20:32,559
Oh Allah.

961
01:20:33,480 --> 01:20:38,399
You are the One who protected
Hadrath Ibrahim from fire.

962
01:20:39,040 --> 01:20:41,879
The One who protected
Hadrath Nuh from the storm.

963
01:20:43,160 --> 01:20:44,999
Oh Allah.

964
01:20:47,240 --> 01:20:49,119
Oh Allah.

965
01:20:50,080 --> 01:20:51,839
Just as You protected...

966
01:20:52,520 --> 01:20:55,119
...Hadrath Yunus' inside
the belly of the fish...

967
01:20:55,680 --> 01:20:57,639
...protect my daughter.

968
01:20:58,320 --> 01:21:01,039
Protect her oh Allah.

969
01:21:05,080 --> 01:21:07,319
My daughter on one hand.

970
01:21:09,680 --> 01:21:11,799
And my land is on the other.

971
01:21:14,600 --> 01:21:18,159
I won't give either of them

972
01:21:18,880 --> 01:21:20,519
I won't give either of them

973
01:21:20,520 --> 01:21:24,039
Oh Allah, give me strength.

974
01:21:24,800 --> 01:21:26,919
Give me power, oh Allah.

975
01:21:27,880 --> 01:21:29,639
Give me power.

976
01:21:30,680 --> 01:21:32,759
Give me power.

977
01:21:44,080 --> 01:21:45,919
Ameen, Osman.

978
01:21:46,200 --> 01:21:47,439
Ameen.

979
01:21:49,800 --> 01:21:52,159
I know your heart is on fire.

980
01:21:52,680 --> 01:21:55,639
You are hiding it, but I can see it.

981
01:21:59,040 --> 01:22:01,719
I recognize the pain, because I have the same.

982
01:22:06,480 --> 01:22:08,919
I won't hide it, Osman.

983
01:22:09,240 --> 01:22:10,999
I am scared.

984
01:22:11,880 --> 01:22:13,279
Allah knows...

985
01:22:14,600 --> 01:22:17,399
...we were tested with our child before.

986
01:22:19,640 --> 01:22:20,679
But it's different.

987
01:22:21,560 --> 01:22:23,119
I swear to you Bala.

988
01:22:23,920 --> 01:22:25,039
The infidels...

989
01:22:26,080 --> 01:22:28,399
...try to hurt our children.

990
01:22:29,560 --> 01:22:30,919
They try to hurt us.

991
01:22:31,960 --> 01:22:32,959
No.

992
01:22:34,280 --> 01:22:35,999
I never bowed down to anyone.

993
01:22:36,560 --> 01:22:37,679
Anyone.

994
01:22:38,640 --> 01:22:39,959
Fatma won't do it either.

995
01:22:42,240 --> 01:22:43,919
She's her father's girl.

996
01:22:44,680 --> 01:22:45,559
She's strong.

997
01:22:46,520 --> 01:22:47,879
She is.

998
01:22:49,440 --> 01:22:50,879
She is strong.

999
01:22:51,640 --> 01:22:52,719
They live for the state...

1000
01:22:54,640 --> 01:22:55,879
...the state lives for them.

1001
01:22:57,280 --> 01:22:58,919
Fatma knows it well.

1002
01:22:59,480 --> 01:23:01,199
She won't bow down.

1003
01:23:02,000 --> 01:23:02,759
Never.

1004
01:23:05,920 --> 01:23:07,079
She won't Osman.

1005
01:23:08,040 --> 01:23:08,719
She won't.

1006
01:23:11,800 --> 01:23:12,959
She won't.

1007
01:23:16,320 --> 01:23:17,199
Allah.

1008
01:23:18,320 --> 01:23:20,639
You're Strong enough for all.

1009
01:23:21,280 --> 01:23:22,639
Give us strength.

1010
01:23:23,680 --> 01:23:25,159
Don't make me bow down.

1011
01:23:26,920 --> 01:23:29,439
Don't test my mother...

1012
01:23:30,160 --> 01:23:31,119
...and my father...

1013
01:23:32,000 --> 01:23:33,999
...with this pain.

1014
01:23:38,160 --> 01:23:39,799
They can't handle it again.

1015
01:23:50,880 --> 01:23:52,079
Ameen.

1016
01:23:52,400 --> 01:23:55,359
I heard your your sister died.

1017
01:24:00,200 --> 01:24:02,199
It happened long ago.

1018
01:24:08,040 --> 01:24:09,679
How did it happen?

1019
01:24:16,920 --> 01:24:18,639
None of your business.

1020
01:24:19,280 --> 01:24:22,959
Don't you dare speak of my sister.

1021
01:24:24,640 --> 01:24:26,959
I don't even remember her name.

1022
01:24:32,920 --> 01:24:34,399
Poor thing.

1023
01:24:35,960 --> 01:24:37,759
Did you miss her?

1024
01:24:39,920 --> 01:24:40,959
Poor thing.

1025
01:24:44,800 --> 01:24:46,559
Soon.

1026
01:24:48,360 --> 01:24:50,959
Soon you'll be with her.

1027
01:24:54,280 --> 01:24:55,319
Is that okay?

1028
01:24:57,800 --> 01:25:00,399
Then your brothers will join.

1029
01:25:09,360 --> 01:25:12,879
You can never hurt them.

1030
01:25:14,160 --> 01:25:15,639
Then Bala...

1031
01:25:16,960 --> 01:25:18,399
And of course...

1032
01:25:19,440 --> 01:25:21,799
I'll kill your father too.

1033
01:25:27,680 --> 01:25:30,999
No. You can't touch them.

1034
01:25:31,480 --> 01:25:33,519
You're not strong enough.

1035
01:25:34,680 --> 01:25:36,039
Allah is with us.

1036
01:26:08,760 --> 01:26:11,319
We'll leave with Alaeddin and the Alps at dawn.

1037
01:26:12,320 --> 01:26:13,319
Fatma..

1038
01:26:14,640 --> 01:26:17,359
...my sister will be saved, God willing.

1039
01:26:27,120 --> 01:26:29,319
But the infidels...

1040
01:26:30,080 --> 01:26:33,399
They won't be able to get away from us.

1041
01:26:34,880 --> 01:26:37,759
I'll do anything to kill
them. I'll risk my life.

1042
01:26:39,440 --> 01:26:41,959
I'm ready to do whatever I can for Fatma.

1043
01:26:43,840 --> 01:26:45,279
I'll give my life for her too.

1044
01:26:47,360 --> 01:26:49,199
But when it's about your life...

1045
01:26:51,200 --> 01:26:52,599
...I get so scared.

1046
01:27:07,640 --> 01:27:09,159
My sweet Orhan.

1047
01:27:10,160 --> 01:27:12,599
Let this protect you, okay?

1048
01:27:12,760 --> 01:27:15,359
Let this give you strength.

1049
01:27:18,440 --> 01:27:20,199
Holofira..

1050
01:27:21,800 --> 01:27:24,559
My kind hearted one...

1051
01:27:25,480 --> 01:27:27,479
My beautiful faced one.

1052
01:27:27,480 --> 01:27:29,359
Of course.

1053
01:27:29,360 --> 01:27:31,279
But tell me...

1054
01:27:31,280 --> 01:27:34,199
...where did this
Jawshan Kabir come from?

1055
01:27:36,600 --> 01:27:38,559
At the bazaar.

1056
01:27:38,840 --> 01:27:41,239
When I heard about Fatma..

1057
01:27:41,240 --> 01:27:42,879
We need to go to the tribe.

1058
01:27:42,880 --> 01:27:44,679
They must've heard about Fatma.

1059
01:27:44,680 --> 01:27:46,999
We need to reassure the people.

1060
01:27:47,000 --> 01:27:50,319
I'll talk with the women here.
Begum Hatun isn't here either.

1061
01:27:50,320 --> 01:27:51,879
They'll take care of the bazaar.

1062
01:27:51,880 --> 01:27:53,439
Okay.

1063
01:27:54,360 --> 01:27:56,119
Come on Gulce.

1064
01:27:56,200 --> 01:27:57,799
God...

1065
01:27:57,800 --> 01:27:59,599
...protect them.

1066
01:27:59,600 --> 01:28:01,639
Show mercy to them.

1067
01:28:01,640 --> 01:28:05,399
It felt like my heart was
being crushed by a mountain.

1068
01:28:05,600 --> 01:28:07,399
A random aunt...

1069
01:28:07,600 --> 01:28:09,679
She gifted this to me.

1070
01:28:09,680 --> 01:28:13,159
You're Osman Bey's daughter in law right?

1071
01:28:14,200 --> 01:28:17,439
Your heart feels heavy, right girl?

1072
01:28:17,440 --> 01:28:19,599
Do you have a problem or...

1073
01:28:19,600 --> 01:28:22,119
I got some bad news.

1074
01:28:30,840 --> 01:28:33,599
Your heart feels like it was set aflame.

1075
01:28:33,600 --> 01:28:36,119
Let this be a gift from me.

1076
01:28:36,120 --> 01:28:37,639
It's a Jawshan.

1077
01:28:37,640 --> 01:28:41,719
May Allah protect you from all kinds of evil.

1078
01:28:42,600 --> 01:28:47,039
When I held it, it felt like
the pressure I felt lightened.

1079
01:28:47,280 --> 01:28:50,559
I said, okay nothing will happen to Fatma.

1080
01:28:50,680 --> 01:28:52,319
God willing.

1081
01:28:53,120 --> 01:28:55,599
Let this protect you too.

1082
01:29:02,400 --> 01:29:07,439
So that woman helped you
just like Hadrath Hizir huh?

1083
01:29:08,640 --> 01:29:10,599
Hizir?

1084
01:29:12,480 --> 01:29:14,319
Who is he?

1085
01:29:14,520 --> 01:29:16,359
Hadrath Hizir...

1086
01:29:16,360 --> 01:29:19,799
...is the one that accompanied
Hadrath Musa in Al-Kahf.

1087
01:29:19,800 --> 01:29:24,159
The one who rushes to help the ones in need.

1088
01:29:25,560 --> 01:29:27,079
Holofira.

1089
01:29:27,080 --> 01:29:29,399
Once we save Fatma...

1090
01:29:29,400 --> 01:29:32,119
Once we get rid of these troubles...

1091
01:29:32,120 --> 01:29:36,159
...do you want me to read
you the Al-Kahf to you?

1092
01:29:36,160 --> 01:29:39,559
You can learn who he is from the verses.

1093
01:29:39,560 --> 01:29:41,119
Will you really?

1094
01:29:41,120 --> 01:29:43,039
Of course.

1095
01:29:44,120 --> 01:29:46,799
Yes. I'd love that.

1096
01:29:48,400 --> 01:29:50,759
Holofira..

1097
01:30:04,520 --> 01:30:08,079
Bayhan betrayed Osman for his son.

1098
01:30:09,240 --> 01:30:10,879
Good.

1099
01:30:11,920 --> 01:30:14,799
Good job Bayhan.

1100
01:30:15,440 --> 01:30:17,759
Where did you come from?

1101
01:30:17,880 --> 01:30:20,079
From the dungeons.

1102
01:30:21,640 --> 01:30:24,719
She never gives up right? That little devil...

1103
01:30:24,720 --> 01:30:27,399
She's stubborn just like her father.

1104
01:30:29,200 --> 01:30:33,319
I'm more stubborn than them, Lucas.

1105
01:30:35,280 --> 01:30:38,359
If you know your enemy well...

1106
01:30:38,600 --> 01:30:43,759
...you'll always start the
fight one step ahead of them.

1107
01:30:45,080 --> 01:30:52,199
I know how to hurt them,
how to break their will so well.

1108
01:30:56,080 --> 01:30:57,679
Now.

1109
01:30:59,680 --> 01:31:03,439
What did Bayhan say? What is Osman's plan?

1110
01:31:03,440 --> 01:31:04,679
Tell me.

1111
01:31:04,680 --> 01:31:06,039
Bayhan...

1112
01:31:10,040 --> 01:31:13,359
There's a letter from your daughter Poena.

1113
01:31:15,800 --> 01:31:18,679
Do you have a daughter Sofia?

1114
01:31:20,160 --> 01:31:21,759
Poena.

1115
01:31:24,160 --> 01:31:27,359
My little brutal angel.

1116
01:31:29,160 --> 01:31:32,239
How can you keep this from me?

1117
01:31:33,240 --> 01:31:37,519
There's still a lot of things you
have to learn about me, Lucas.

1118
01:31:38,200 --> 01:31:39,839
Poena.

1119
01:31:39,960 --> 01:31:42,399
So, I have a niece.

1120
01:31:42,640 --> 01:31:45,919
What does she say? Is she coming here?

1121
01:31:46,800 --> 01:31:50,439
Impatient little devil...

1122
01:31:51,120 --> 01:31:55,279
She's asking for permission to come to me but...

1123
01:31:57,400 --> 01:31:59,719
...not now.

1124
01:32:02,880 --> 01:32:06,239
When the time comes, I'll bring her here.

1125
01:32:07,400 --> 01:32:09,119
Poena.

1126
01:32:10,160 --> 01:32:11,719
What's its meaning?

1127
01:32:11,880 --> 01:32:13,719
The punisher...

1128
01:32:14,240 --> 01:32:18,399
...of the Goddess of Punishment, Nemesis.

1129
01:32:20,160 --> 01:32:24,399
Revenge, the soul of pain.

1130
01:32:28,120 --> 01:32:29,919
Poena.

1131
01:32:31,160 --> 01:32:34,159
Why do you put such a name, Sofia?

1132
01:32:35,120 --> 01:32:36,839
I'll tell you later.

1133
01:32:39,920 --> 01:32:41,439
Now...

1134
01:32:42,080 --> 01:32:46,079
You tell me the things you learned from Bayhan.

1135
01:32:50,680 --> 01:32:54,919
Fatma! Daughter! Say something

1136
01:32:55,080 --> 01:32:57,999
I'm here, daughter! I'm here

1137
01:32:58,600 --> 01:33:01,879
Fatma! I'm here! I'm here, daughter.

1138
01:33:01,960 --> 01:33:03,759
I'll save you.

1139
01:33:04,000 --> 01:33:05,639
Fatma

1140
01:33:16,520 --> 01:33:18,199
What is this?

1141
01:33:18,680 --> 01:33:20,479
How can it be?

1142
01:33:31,880 --> 01:33:33,959
Why are they here?

1143
01:33:34,080 --> 01:33:38,039
Who hung these? Where is the flag of Kayi?

1144
01:33:42,560 --> 01:33:43,999
Don't do it! I beg you!

1145
01:33:44,000 --> 01:33:47,239
We are divided!
Our state has fallen!

1146
01:33:47,240 --> 01:33:49,319
Osman Bey lost Sogut!

1147
01:33:49,360 --> 01:33:52,039
Where can we go now?

1148
01:33:52,120 --> 01:33:54,919
No. No.

1149
01:33:55,240 --> 01:33:58,759
We lost nothing.
Sogut still belongs to us.

1150
01:33:59,320 --> 01:34:02,079
Our state stays strong

1151
01:34:03,360 --> 01:34:05,719
Sogut is gone!

1152
01:34:05,840 --> 01:34:07,959
Who says this?

1153
01:34:21,720 --> 01:34:23,199
Fatma?

1154
01:34:25,880 --> 01:34:27,319
My Fatma

1155
01:34:27,760 --> 01:34:30,519
Daughter! I'm here!

1156
01:34:32,360 --> 01:34:36,439
My blue-eyed daughter! My beautiful daughter!

1157
01:34:36,680 --> 01:34:41,239
Don't be afraid. No one can
hurt you. You are safe now.

1158
01:34:43,320 --> 01:34:46,319
Come here. Come here.

1159
01:35:10,040 --> 01:35:12,359
What are you doing here?

1160
01:35:19,880 --> 01:35:23,759
You, dastard! What
are you doing here?

1161
01:35:25,360 --> 01:35:27,519
Don't you dare touch my daughter!

1162
01:35:28,320 --> 01:35:31,199
You are late, Osman.

1163
01:35:31,640 --> 01:35:33,479
You lost Sogut.

1164
01:35:33,520 --> 01:35:37,599
Don't you dare to
touch Fatma! I'll kill you

1165
01:35:40,720 --> 01:35:43,239
And it's time for...

1166
01:35:45,160 --> 01:35:47,759
...your daughter, Fatma.

1167
01:35:48,760 --> 01:35:52,159
I'll kill you! I'll kill you now!

1168
01:35:56,840 --> 01:35:58,399
Don't do it, Fatma.

1169
01:36:04,880 --> 01:36:06,599
Don't do it, daughter.

1170
01:36:11,720 --> 01:36:13,479
Don't touch her!

1171
01:36:15,520 --> 01:36:20,119
-I am her executioner.
-You dog!

1172
01:36:34,160 --> 01:36:35,359
Father.

1173
01:36:54,960 --> 01:36:56,239
Father.

1174
01:37:12,280 --> 01:37:14,279
No! My Allah!

1175
01:37:28,800 --> 01:37:29,559
No.

1176
01:37:32,000 --> 01:37:33,319
No.

1177
01:37:33,760 --> 01:37:34,839
No!

1178
01:37:35,200 --> 01:37:39,599
No!

1179
01:37:40,120 --> 01:37:43,759
Fatma

1180
01:37:50,920 --> 01:37:52,159
Osman.

1181
01:37:59,360 --> 01:38:00,879
Oh Allah.

1182
01:38:00,880 --> 01:38:04,479
Oh Allah, give me strength to
save my daughter from them.

1183
01:38:04,800 --> 01:38:06,639
Grant me power and patience.

1184
01:38:07,600 --> 01:38:09,079
Ameen.

1185
01:38:10,520 --> 01:38:12,439
We will wake up to a better morning, Osman.

1186
01:38:12,440 --> 01:38:13,799
God willing.

1187
01:38:14,160 --> 01:38:16,799
The pain in our hearts will go away, God willing.

1188
01:38:17,160 --> 01:38:18,439
God willing.

1189
01:38:19,360 --> 01:38:20,999
God willing. God willing.

1190
01:38:23,640 --> 01:38:27,119
Kayi Tribe

1191
01:38:29,120 --> 01:38:30,399
Alaeddin.

1192
01:38:31,600 --> 01:38:33,919
I should come with you.

1193
01:38:35,200 --> 01:38:38,279
It's hard to sit and wait.

1194
01:38:38,280 --> 01:38:38,999
No.

1195
01:38:39,800 --> 01:38:41,039
You'll protect the tribe.

1196
01:38:44,320 --> 01:38:45,879
Don't worry sweetheart.

1197
01:38:47,480 --> 01:38:49,039
We'll save my sister.

1198
01:38:50,800 --> 01:38:51,919
We will.

1199
01:38:59,840 --> 01:39:02,519
Your love for Fatma is different Alaeddin.

1200
01:39:18,080 --> 01:39:19,919
My sister...

1201
01:39:28,160 --> 01:39:31,119
When we lost Halime so young..

1202
01:39:32,520 --> 01:39:35,279
...I devoted myself to Fatma so much.

1203
01:39:37,720 --> 01:39:42,039
She healed our never healing wounds.

1204
01:39:46,280 --> 01:39:49,559
From that day on, I never left her side.

1205
01:39:53,440 --> 01:39:55,839
My beautiful sister...

1206
01:39:58,320 --> 01:39:59,439
My dear sister...

1207
01:40:07,960 --> 01:40:10,599
A sibling is something else Alaeddin.

1208
01:40:11,760 --> 01:40:15,959
Their absence creates a hole in your heart.

1209
01:40:18,480 --> 01:40:19,919
It's impossible to fill.

1210
01:40:24,640 --> 01:40:25,959
But...

1211
01:40:29,480 --> 01:40:31,959
...you will reunite with your sister.

1212
01:40:34,000 --> 01:40:35,479
God willing.

1213
01:40:36,800 --> 01:40:40,519
God willing, we will save Fatma.

1214
01:40:42,280 --> 01:40:43,439
Alaeddin.

1215
01:40:44,720 --> 01:40:45,999
Brother.

1216
01:40:50,000 --> 01:40:52,639
Come on brother, it's time.

1217
01:40:52,840 --> 01:40:54,719
Let's go and save our sister.

1218
01:40:55,400 --> 01:40:58,159
Let's go and bring her back home.

1219
01:40:58,280 --> 01:41:00,599
Yes.

1220
01:41:01,160 --> 01:41:03,679
There is no joy in the tribe without her.

1221
01:41:04,280 --> 01:41:05,719
Right.

1222
01:41:06,560 --> 01:41:07,999
Come on.

1223
01:41:12,480 --> 01:41:14,559
May Allah protect you.

1224
01:41:14,920 --> 01:41:16,799
You too.

1225
01:41:24,600 --> 01:41:27,279
Safe travels.

1226
01:41:28,320 --> 01:41:31,399
Bala, we will go and get our daughter back.

1227
01:41:31,520 --> 01:41:34,879
Fatma will prepare dinner tonight,
and tease her brothers again.

1228
01:41:35,080 --> 01:41:37,079
She will hide behind us.

1229
01:41:37,200 --> 01:41:38,559
She will come.

1230
01:41:38,560 --> 01:41:39,719
She will.

1231
01:41:39,880 --> 01:41:42,759
We will ruin their traps!

1232
01:41:43,040 --> 01:41:45,359
Our sons will get Fatma back.

1233
01:41:45,640 --> 01:41:47,679
And we will go for Sogut.

1234
01:41:47,680 --> 01:41:49,359
Can I come in my Bey?

1235
01:41:50,720 --> 01:41:52,399
Come in, Turahan.

1236
01:41:56,920 --> 01:41:59,439
My Bey. Karesi Bey is coming.

1237
01:42:05,160 --> 01:42:06,519
Call the Beys.

1238
01:42:06,520 --> 01:42:08,159
As you command, my Bey.

1239
01:43:04,120 --> 01:43:05,799
Osman...

1240
01:43:06,720 --> 01:43:09,159
You will make the decision.

1241
01:43:09,480 --> 01:43:13,079
You will either listen to me, or...

1242
01:43:13,640 --> 01:43:19,599
...these people who are in despair
and ashamed of what you are doing...

1243
01:43:19,760 --> 01:43:22,599
...will come to me for hope.

1244
01:44:02,680 --> 01:44:08,279
Bayhan Bey's blindness will be your end, Osman.

1245
01:44:11,440 --> 01:44:14,639
It will be a pity
for his big plan.

1246
01:44:27,840 --> 01:44:31,799
They're ready to replace
the prisoners as you wish.

1247
01:44:46,640 --> 01:44:47,399
Good.

1248
01:44:48,840 --> 01:44:49,519
Good.

1249
01:44:51,680 --> 01:44:54,159
Fatma will stay in the dungeon.

1250
01:44:55,120 --> 01:44:57,479
Don't even give water to those idiots.

1251
01:44:58,080 --> 01:45:00,159
So they'll learn their lesson.

1252
01:45:04,760 --> 01:45:05,919
Prepare the horses.

1253
01:45:12,600 --> 01:45:13,039
Today...

1254
01:45:14,480 --> 01:45:17,479
Today will be our biggest victory, Sofia.

1255
01:45:18,920 --> 01:45:22,879
We'll take Sogut from Osman.

1256
01:45:27,360 --> 01:45:29,559
Akhisar Castle

1257
01:45:29,800 --> 01:45:30,599
Wait.

1258
01:45:31,520 --> 01:45:32,919
Where are you coming from?

1259
01:45:33,120 --> 01:45:34,919
From Bursa.

1260
01:45:35,240 --> 01:45:37,639
Akhisar's horses are ill.

1261
01:45:38,000 --> 01:45:39,559
I was ordered to bring horses.

1262
01:45:40,160 --> 01:45:41,959
I took care of them well.

1263
01:45:42,960 --> 01:45:45,919
They'll help the Akhisar soldiers.

1264
01:45:46,200 --> 01:45:48,359
That's enough. I know about this.

1265
01:45:48,360 --> 01:45:49,479
You shall pass.

1266
01:45:49,480 --> 01:45:50,679
Open the gates.

1267
01:46:00,600 --> 01:46:03,599
I told you not to do it.

1268
01:46:03,600 --> 01:46:08,239
I told you not to go into
Akhisar but you never listened.

1269
01:46:09,560 --> 01:46:14,079
Now, everyone knows
that those who don't listen...

1270
01:46:14,320 --> 01:46:17,519
...will fail and lose their power.

1271
01:46:19,360 --> 01:46:23,279
In return for your child's life...

1272
01:46:23,280 --> 01:46:24,599
...infidels wanted...

1273
01:46:25,200 --> 01:46:28,919
...Sogut, the heart of your state.

1274
01:46:29,560 --> 01:46:32,459
Now,
what I am saying is...

1275
01:46:32,459 --> 01:46:35,079
Cut it short Karesibey.

1276
01:46:36,320 --> 01:46:41,079
To give up Sogut, a Turk's land to infidels...

1277
01:46:41,080 --> 01:46:43,079
...is the biggest ignorance.

1278
01:46:43,760 --> 01:46:44,479
Come...

1279
01:46:45,440 --> 01:46:49,199
...and announce you and
your Beys are under my rule....

1280
01:46:49,480 --> 01:46:54,759
...so that I can help
you with all of my power.

1281
01:46:55,800 --> 01:46:59,079
You can both keep Sogut...

1282
01:46:59,080 --> 01:47:02,279
...and save your children's lives.

1283
01:47:07,840 --> 01:47:08,999
You are...

1284
01:47:11,000 --> 01:47:14,199
...a Bey who has worked with many infidels.

1285
01:47:16,440 --> 01:47:18,239
Why would I side with you?

1286
01:47:18,760 --> 01:47:19,319
Yes.

1287
01:47:20,320 --> 01:47:23,399
Do you see now which one of us...

1288
01:47:23,960 --> 01:47:25,759
...doesn't want to unite?

1289
01:47:26,440 --> 01:47:27,319
To unite...

1290
01:47:28,600 --> 01:47:29,839
You're right.

1291
01:47:30,200 --> 01:47:32,759
You said if you go to Akhisar...

1292
01:47:34,960 --> 01:47:36,519
...we'd be enemies.

1293
01:47:36,560 --> 01:47:39,119
And without thinking, you said...

1294
01:47:39,120 --> 01:47:41,599
...'I have Akhisar now'...

1295
01:47:42,000 --> 01:47:45,239
...'and I'll deal with you later.'

1296
01:47:45,760 --> 01:47:46,839
That's it.

1297
01:47:49,440 --> 01:47:51,719
I still keep my word Karesi Bey.

1298
01:47:54,440 --> 01:47:58,879
You're going after battles you can't win.

1299
01:48:01,200 --> 01:48:06,039
...and those who follow you will be
defeated in the battles you'll participate.

1300
01:48:11,800 --> 01:48:13,039
Karesi Bey.

1301
01:48:17,400 --> 01:48:19,519
Me and the men who follow me...

1302
01:48:21,280 --> 01:48:23,039
...are enough to take you out.

1303
01:48:24,520 --> 01:48:25,999
Don't you worry.

1304
01:48:31,800 --> 01:48:33,199
Karesi Bey.

1305
01:48:37,640 --> 01:48:39,759
The castle gates are opening.

1306
01:49:16,680 --> 01:49:18,159
The prisoners' faces are covered.

1307
01:49:18,720 --> 01:49:19,999
How will we know?

1308
01:49:40,840 --> 01:49:43,279
As we thought, Alaeddin.

1309
01:49:43,440 --> 01:49:45,239
That's not Fatma.

1310
01:49:46,560 --> 01:49:48,839
How did you know my Shahzade?

1311
01:49:49,000 --> 01:49:52,319
We're siblings, Boran Bey.

1312
01:49:52,600 --> 01:49:55,679
Our father trained us a lot.

1313
01:49:56,040 --> 01:49:58,719
If that was our Fatma...

1314
01:49:58,880 --> 01:50:02,399
...she would've heard us
and let us know that's her.

1315
01:50:10,760 --> 01:50:12,759
Hold on sister.

1316
01:50:13,200 --> 01:50:14,759
Hold on.

1317
01:50:15,160 --> 01:50:18,039
Your brothers will come and get you.

1318
01:50:18,200 --> 01:50:19,719
Come on.

1319
01:50:27,840 --> 01:50:28,759
Water...

1320
01:50:31,720 --> 01:50:33,559
Give us water...

1321
01:50:33,680 --> 01:50:37,319
He's asking for water. Don't
you hear him? Give him water.

1322
01:50:37,840 --> 01:50:39,199
Saruca

1323
01:50:39,200 --> 01:50:40,839
Hold on.

1324
01:50:40,840 --> 01:50:42,759
Hold on Saruca.

1325
01:50:43,240 --> 01:50:44,999
Hold on.

1326
01:50:46,520 --> 01:50:49,119
It's all my fault.

1327
01:50:50,680 --> 01:50:53,159
That devil wanted me.

1328
01:50:55,200 --> 01:50:57,799
You're not guilty.

1329
01:50:59,040 --> 01:51:01,319
Don't be sad.

1330
01:51:01,560 --> 01:51:03,399
Let's think of it like we're fasting.

1331
01:51:03,400 --> 01:51:05,199
Fatma Hatun.

1332
01:51:05,520 --> 01:51:08,799
Don't mind Saruca, Fatma Hatun.

1333
01:51:09,200 --> 01:51:14,039
He's a bit fussy, he's a mama's boy after all.

1334
01:51:14,640 --> 01:51:20,719
Is this coming from Yusuf Bey
who is living under his sister's shadow?

1335
01:51:23,800 --> 01:51:25,679
Now...

1336
01:51:25,680 --> 01:51:28,839
Now, the enemy will have Sogut as well...

1337
01:51:28,840 --> 01:51:31,759
Who knows what else that devil asked for...

1338
01:51:31,760 --> 01:51:36,079
We have to get you out of here
before that devil is here, but how?

1339
01:51:38,800 --> 01:51:40,959
We'll find a way.

1340
01:51:42,520 --> 01:51:44,999
We will.

1341
01:51:56,000 --> 01:51:57,799
I've brought food for the captives.

1342
01:51:57,800 --> 01:52:01,199
I wished they died from starvation but...

1343
01:52:01,280 --> 01:52:03,959
...commander Lucas doesn't want them to die.

1344
01:52:04,960 --> 01:52:06,959
Give those to us, we'll give them the food.

1345
01:52:06,960 --> 01:52:08,519
No one else will go in there but us.

1346
01:52:08,520 --> 01:52:10,439
You're tired.

1347
01:52:10,440 --> 01:52:12,959
I'll take care of it.

1348
01:52:14,160 --> 01:52:17,239
You go, we'll do it.

1349
01:52:45,720 --> 01:52:47,319
Water.

1350
01:52:47,320 --> 01:52:49,319
So you wanted water...

1351
01:52:49,840 --> 01:52:52,119
Here you go, water.

1352
01:52:57,800 --> 01:52:59,319
Lowlife.

1353
01:53:04,520 --> 01:53:05,999
Ilbay?

1354
01:53:16,840 --> 01:53:20,039
That's Ilbay, thank Allah. Thank Allah.

1355
01:53:21,800 --> 01:53:23,999
Fatma Hatun.
-Ilbay.

1356
01:53:25,000 --> 01:53:27,719
-Ilbay.
-Brother, Ilbay.

1357
01:53:28,600 --> 01:53:30,959
Thank you brother.

1358
01:53:31,640 --> 01:53:33,439
Make haste.

1359
01:53:36,680 --> 01:53:39,319
How did you get in Ilbay?

1360
01:53:40,000 --> 01:53:43,319
We don't have time, Fatma Hatun.
Wear these and let's get out of here.

1361
01:53:43,320 --> 01:53:44,959
Come on.

1362
01:54:27,440 --> 01:54:29,439
Hey people!

1363
01:54:30,080 --> 01:54:31,719
My Beys.

1364
01:54:32,000 --> 01:54:34,599
My sisters. My brothers.

1365
01:54:35,160 --> 01:54:36,439
Now...

1366
01:54:37,600 --> 01:54:39,999
Everywhere you'll settle is ready.

1367
01:54:40,200 --> 01:54:44,479
Everywhere is prepared.
Everything you'll need we'll be there.

1368
01:54:44,800 --> 01:54:46,519
But I know.

1369
01:54:47,120 --> 01:54:50,599
You feel pain for what you're doing.

1370
01:54:50,720 --> 01:54:56,519
You don't want to leave your
house, your home and your land.

1371
01:54:59,600 --> 01:55:03,119
I know it is a heavy burden
on you. I know this very well.

1372
01:55:03,280 --> 01:55:06,299
The houses are not
important, Osman Bey.

1373
01:55:06,311 --> 01:55:09,679
Our blood is mixed with this
land and we leave it now.

1374
01:55:12,480 --> 01:55:17,359
We sacrificed many of our
sons and daughters for Sogut.

1375
01:55:17,720 --> 01:55:20,959
I pray to Allah that you have a plan.

1376
01:55:21,120 --> 01:55:24,959
We knew you as a different
man. You never do such a thing.

1377
01:55:31,120 --> 01:55:32,799
Now I know...

1378
01:55:33,840 --> 01:55:36,719
I know you are upset with me.

1379
01:55:36,960 --> 01:55:39,399
But you should also know this.

1380
01:55:41,160 --> 01:55:45,679
I've done only the thing I need to do.

1381
01:55:56,600 --> 01:55:58,599
Farewell now.

1382
01:55:59,280 --> 01:56:00,879
Farewell.

1383
01:56:09,480 --> 01:56:14,319
We'll get it all back, my Bey.
They don't know the truth.

1384
01:56:16,400 --> 01:56:21,959
The devilish woman, who
did all this to us and Lukas.

1385
01:56:22,840 --> 01:56:27,319
I'll make them pay in a way
no one has ever seen before.

1386
01:56:33,920 --> 01:56:39,719
I'll take the revenge of Sogut
and all the people cried...

1387
01:56:40,280 --> 01:56:42,119
...in such a way that...

1388
01:56:42,720 --> 01:56:44,879
I swear it.

1389
01:57:03,440 --> 01:57:06,159
You said you were going to save our son.

1390
01:57:10,360 --> 01:57:13,879
I have no one to trust but you, Bayhan Bey.

1391
01:57:15,320 --> 01:57:18,359
-You'll save him, right?
-We'll save him.

1392
01:57:18,640 --> 01:57:21,759
Our son will be with you
safe and sound today.

1393
01:57:32,360 --> 01:57:33,999
Hazal Hatun.

1394
01:57:37,440 --> 01:57:41,039
I know we don't like each other at all.

1395
01:57:43,000 --> 01:57:45,879
But we got the same wound.

1396
01:57:46,040 --> 01:57:52,759
You should know that I add Saruca
And Fatma to my prayers for Yusuf.

1397
01:57:53,200 --> 01:57:54,959
Oh, Black Widow!

1398
01:58:01,480 --> 01:58:05,079
Excuse me, please. It's
because of the pain I have.

1399
01:58:07,480 --> 01:58:09,359
Begum Hatun.

1400
01:58:10,440 --> 01:58:13,319
May Allah protect our children.

1401
01:58:13,640 --> 01:58:14,999
Ameen.

1402
01:58:16,000 --> 01:58:20,279
I also pray for your brother.

1403
01:58:20,520 --> 01:58:22,479
Thank you.

1404
01:58:23,440 --> 01:58:27,279
It's time to be united now.

1405
01:59:06,240 --> 01:59:07,959
Open the gates!

1406
01:59:08,120 --> 01:59:11,079
Commander Lukas sent us. He got the news!

1407
01:59:11,280 --> 01:59:13,279
Osman will kidnap the prisoners!

1408
01:59:13,360 --> 01:59:15,639
We'll secure the castle! Come on!

1409
01:59:15,720 --> 01:59:20,599
This is the last order of Commander Lukas.
Gates will not be opened until his arrival!

1410
01:59:22,520 --> 01:59:27,119
If you don't open the gates,
you'll pay for it with your lives!

1411
01:59:27,760 --> 01:59:30,079
They will save the
prisoners! Didn't you hear us!?

1412
01:59:31,080 --> 01:59:34,879
Even if you are Commander Lucas'
soldier, these gates won't open!

1413
01:59:34,880 --> 01:59:38,079
Oh Allah. What are we going to do now?

1414
01:59:40,520 --> 01:59:44,479
One way or another, those gates will be opened.

1415
01:59:52,640 --> 01:59:54,719
Come quickly!

1416
01:59:54,720 --> 01:59:57,719
The prisoners escaped! They killed the soldiers!

1417
01:59:58,640 --> 02:00:02,119
Oh Allah, help us.

1418
02:00:04,120 --> 02:00:06,759
Soldiers! What we said came true!

1419
02:00:06,760 --> 02:00:10,039
Open the gates, or the prisoners will escape!

1420
02:00:10,040 --> 02:00:12,399
Don't you hear us!

1421
02:00:12,400 --> 02:00:13,439
Come on!

1422
02:00:13,800 --> 02:00:18,039
If the prisoners escape, you
will be responsible for this!

1423
02:00:18,480 --> 02:00:19,999
Open the gates!

1424
02:00:20,000 --> 02:00:21,879
That's better.

1425
02:00:22,760 --> 02:00:25,879
Hold on sister, we are coming.

1426
02:00:25,880 --> 02:00:27,879
Come on.

1427
02:00:30,440 --> 02:00:33,759
The prisoners are running away! Spread out!

1428
02:01:01,560 --> 02:01:03,199
Brother?

1429
02:01:04,400 --> 02:01:06,279
Fatma..

1430
02:01:10,440 --> 02:01:11,879
You, stop.

1431
02:01:13,280 --> 02:01:14,519
Remove your helmet.

1432
02:01:14,800 --> 02:01:17,279
I am telling you, remove your helmet!

1433
02:01:25,240 --> 02:01:26,439
Boran.

1434
02:01:28,640 --> 02:01:30,239
Shields!

1435
02:01:30,240 --> 02:01:31,479
Come on!

1436
02:01:35,800 --> 02:01:36,999
Shields!

1437
02:01:37,320 --> 02:01:37,879
Fire!

1438
02:01:38,600 --> 02:01:40,759
The Righteous!

1439
02:01:41,320 --> 02:01:43,079
Shields!

1440
02:01:44,040 --> 02:01:46,599
The Righteous!

1441
02:01:46,600 --> 02:01:49,199
-Allah is the Greatest!
-Allah is the Greatest!

1442
02:01:53,800 --> 02:01:55,759
The Righteous!

1443
02:01:57,440 --> 02:02:00,959
-Allah is eternal!
-Allah is right!

1444
02:02:43,680 --> 02:02:46,159
Allah is the Greatest!

1445
02:03:00,520 --> 02:03:02,479
Allah is the Greatest!

1446
02:03:03,400 --> 02:03:05,279
Which dastard hit me?

1447
02:03:05,280 --> 02:03:08,319
Which of you dastards beat me in the prison!?

1448
02:03:08,680 --> 02:03:10,519
Come here, you dog!

1449
02:03:16,080 --> 02:03:17,559
You dastards!

1450
02:03:37,560 --> 02:03:39,759
Allah is the Greatest!

1451
02:03:39,920 --> 02:03:42,799
Alps, bring the horses!

1452
02:03:58,840 --> 02:04:02,039
Open the gates! Come on alps!

1453
02:04:03,640 --> 02:04:05,959
-My shahzade!
-Shields!

1454
02:04:06,240 --> 02:04:07,319
Shields!

1455
02:04:07,320 --> 02:04:08,679
Brother!

1456
02:04:08,680 --> 02:04:11,199
-Brother, are you okay?

1457
02:04:15,520 --> 02:04:17,799
Brother are you okay?

1458
02:04:19,360 --> 02:04:20,959
Brother?

1459
02:04:24,880 --> 02:04:28,599
This arrow could pierce even the
toughest armor. How is this possible?

1460
02:04:35,640 --> 02:04:37,519
This will protect you.

1461
02:04:38,000 --> 02:04:39,239
It'll give you strength.

1462
02:04:45,880 --> 02:04:47,479
I have my strength here.

1463
02:04:48,440 --> 02:04:50,639
We didn't try that brother.

1464
02:04:50,640 --> 02:04:52,639
Thank Allah!
Are you okay sister?

1465
02:04:52,640 --> 02:04:53,719
I'm okay brother.

1466
02:04:53,720 --> 02:04:55,879
Yusuf, Saruca. Are you okay?

1467
02:04:55,880 --> 02:04:57,879
-We're okay my Bey.
-We're okay.

1468
02:05:15,520 --> 02:05:16,799
Allah!

1469
02:05:21,640 --> 02:05:24,959
-Let's leave now.
-Come on!

1470
02:05:24,960 --> 02:05:26,959
Come on! Back on the horses!

1471
02:05:36,240 --> 02:05:37,199
Come on.

1472
02:07:03,960 --> 02:07:05,039
Turahan.

1473
02:07:05,320 --> 02:07:06,679
Did you hide it all?

1474
02:07:06,800 --> 02:07:07,999
Yes my Bey.

1475
02:07:08,560 --> 02:07:10,529
The infidels won't sense anything.

1476
02:07:12,880 --> 02:07:13,959
Open up then.

1477
02:07:18,800 --> 02:07:19,279
What else?

1478
02:07:31,000 --> 02:07:32,009
Thank you.

1479
02:07:33,080 --> 02:07:33,879
Turahan.

1480
02:07:33,900 --> 02:07:34,789
My Bey.

1481
02:07:34,789 --> 02:07:37,759
No one will follow us
except for you and two Alps.

1482
02:07:37,760 --> 02:07:39,759
Alps will go outside the city.

1483
02:07:40,280 --> 02:07:41,479
As you wish my Bey.

1484
02:07:41,760 --> 02:07:43,639
Come on Alps. Let's leave.

1485
02:07:45,440 --> 02:07:48,399
If your plan succeeds, my Bey...

1486
02:07:48,720 --> 02:07:52,799
...the infidels can never take Turk's land.

1487
02:07:53,080 --> 02:07:54,559
The infidels will see...

1488
02:07:55,120 --> 02:07:57,399
...and the people will see the truth Bala.

1489
02:08:04,360 --> 02:08:07,959
My Bey. Gencer Bey's here to see you.

1490
02:08:09,720 --> 02:08:11,279
Let him in.

1491
02:08:20,800 --> 02:08:22,719
Come on in Gencer Bey.

1492
02:08:23,200 --> 02:08:23,919
Come in.

1493
02:08:30,240 --> 02:08:34,359
Know that I didn't put my hand under the rock...

1494
02:08:34,680 --> 02:08:37,479
...I put my whole body under there.

1495
02:08:37,760 --> 02:08:42,279
But, Osman didn't lose his arrogance...

1496
02:08:43,160 --> 02:08:46,399
....and hold the hand I offered him.

1497
02:08:47,960 --> 02:08:48,799
Sogut...

1498
02:08:50,120 --> 02:08:52,239
...will be given to infidels.

1499
02:08:53,400 --> 02:08:56,319
This is defying the tore, Karesi Bey.

1500
02:08:56,400 --> 02:09:00,279
Osman Bey accused me
of failing to protect my land.

1501
02:09:01,920 --> 02:09:02,679
Okay.

1502
02:09:03,920 --> 02:09:07,639
But I'll die before I let the infidels...

1503
02:09:07,640 --> 02:09:09,639
...have a piece of our land.

1504
02:09:11,800 --> 02:09:14,359
Of course not.

1505
02:09:14,360 --> 02:09:17,399
You are an honorable man.

1506
02:09:18,320 --> 02:09:20,999
That's why I'm telling you...

1507
02:09:21,520 --> 02:09:26,679
...you don't belong with Osman anymore.

1508
02:09:29,400 --> 02:09:32,519
What do you mean Karesi Bey?

1509
02:09:33,560 --> 02:09:36,599
Listen to me well.

1510
02:09:37,000 --> 02:09:40,439
These are Osman's last moments.

1511
02:09:40,440 --> 02:09:43,679
Come and swear loyalty to me.

1512
02:09:43,680 --> 02:09:45,999
Join my side...

1513
02:09:46,000 --> 02:09:49,199
...and I'll make you rich.

1514
02:09:58,080 --> 02:10:01,359
I swear loyalty to the one that
makes others lower their heads...

1515
02:10:01,520 --> 02:10:05,039
...not to the one that lower their own head.

1516
02:10:07,600 --> 02:10:11,079
They didn't know we would come here.

1517
02:10:11,080 --> 02:10:12,799
-My bey...
-If not...

1518
02:10:12,800 --> 02:10:17,319
...they wouldn't be sitting
around a fire like this.

1519
02:10:17,320 --> 02:10:19,999
Get out of my sight now.

1520
02:10:20,920 --> 02:10:26,519
Gencer Bey, don't ever make
a mistake like this ever again.

1521
02:10:29,120 --> 02:10:33,319
I asked you to show us a
way out but what did you do?

1522
02:10:33,520 --> 02:10:36,519
You talk about Karesi
who works with the infidels.

1523
02:10:36,520 --> 02:10:40,479
Like that's not enough, you talk over my rule.

1524
02:10:40,480 --> 02:10:41,479
My bey.

1525
02:10:41,480 --> 02:10:43,519
Enough Gencer Bey.

1526
02:11:07,840 --> 02:11:09,359
My bey.

1527
02:11:09,360 --> 02:11:11,119
They're coming.

1528
02:11:38,480 --> 02:11:42,519
Osman emptied out Sogut as he promised.

1529
02:11:42,520 --> 02:11:46,599
And we brought the captives as we promised.

1530
02:11:47,200 --> 02:11:49,159
Let's see...

1531
02:11:49,160 --> 02:11:52,759
...who is going to be the winner today Lucas.

1532
02:12:03,840 --> 02:12:05,679
Let them come.

1533
02:12:06,960 --> 02:12:08,479
Let them...

1534
02:12:09,440 --> 02:12:14,599
Let them come to Sogut where
their dreams will be shattered.

1535
02:12:41,400 --> 02:12:43,199
Fatma.

1536
02:13:42,080 --> 02:13:43,879
According to the agreement...

1537
02:13:43,880 --> 02:13:48,279
...there is no alp or folk left in Sogut.

1538
02:13:52,440 --> 02:13:53,959
Now...

1539
02:13:55,400 --> 02:13:58,759
Now, you should keep your promise too.

1540
02:13:58,840 --> 02:14:01,039
Bring Fatma and the boys.

1541
02:14:01,040 --> 02:14:03,239
What do you think Lucas?

1542
02:14:03,240 --> 02:14:09,799
Should we end Osman and Bala Hatun's misery now?

1543
02:14:11,800 --> 02:14:14,439
Since he kept his promise...

1544
02:14:21,520 --> 02:14:23,919
Bring the captives.

1545
02:14:39,160 --> 02:14:40,439
Fatma

1546
02:14:56,400 --> 02:14:59,199
Fatma. Fatma.

1547
02:15:23,840 --> 02:15:27,159
So, this is your move, huh?

1548
02:15:27,440 --> 02:15:30,119
Who do you think you are kidding, Osman?

1549
02:15:30,560 --> 02:15:37,159
We know that you planted
gunpowder everywhere in Sogut.

1550
02:15:38,000 --> 02:15:43,679
So you were going to destroy the city
on us, after you got your daughter, huh?

1551
02:15:52,760 --> 02:15:57,999
Know that if there is one spark...

1552
02:16:05,320 --> 02:16:08,199
...Fatma Hatun will die.

1553
02:17:01,600 --> 02:17:05,477
You heard us, Osman. Give
the order to your soldiers.

1554
02:17:05,600 --> 02:17:10,239
Sogut will be cleared of
gunpowder immediately...

1555
02:17:10,400 --> 02:17:14,317
...and it will be surrendered
to us as we agreed.

1556
02:17:19,360 --> 02:17:20,718
Who...

1557
02:17:22,200 --> 02:17:24,839
...led you into this, huh?

1558
02:17:29,440 --> 02:17:33,959
Whose trap have you fallen into?
There is no gunpowder in Sogut.

1559
02:17:35,480 --> 02:17:39,799
I am about to run out of patience, Osman.

1560
02:17:40,240 --> 02:17:44,079
Stop lying and surrender the city immediately.

1561
02:17:44,160 --> 02:17:48,397
If my scout outside can't
get the news from me...

1562
02:17:48,600 --> 02:17:51,397
...your daughter, Fatma, will die.

1563
02:17:54,480 --> 02:17:56,599
You say so, huh?

1564
02:18:16,360 --> 02:18:18,079
Mother! Father!

1565
02:18:36,959 --> 02:18:39,477
How can it be, Lukas?

1566
02:18:43,320 --> 02:18:44,558
Fatma.

1567
02:18:54,040 --> 02:18:55,759
Daughter!

1568
02:18:57,240 --> 02:18:59,317
Thank Allah!

1569
02:19:03,959 --> 02:19:07,317
-Are you fine?
-I'm fine, mother. I'm fine.

1570
02:19:10,480 --> 02:19:12,199
Father!

1571
02:19:39,280 --> 02:19:44,599
Osman is not going to blow up
his family together with us, right?

1572
02:19:48,000 --> 02:19:49,839
Soldiers!

1573
02:19:51,400 --> 02:19:52,959
Alps!

1574
02:20:26,400 --> 02:20:28,279
It's impossible!

1575
02:20:51,800 --> 02:20:54,279
I told you there's no Greek Fire in Sogut.

1576
02:20:56,400 --> 02:20:57,679
Bayhan Bey.

1577
02:20:58,640 --> 02:20:59,599
Begum Hatun.

1578
02:21:32,840 --> 02:21:36,159
...trusted my word.

1579
02:21:42,320 --> 02:21:45,719
You were tricked by me.

1580
02:21:48,720 --> 02:21:52,158
Once we left the headquarters,
Lucas' men dressed

1581
02:21:52,170 --> 02:21:55,759
in an alp's clothes gave
us the same letter, my bey.

1582
02:21:56,320 --> 02:22:02,479
They expect us to betray you for our loved ones.

1583
02:22:03,080 --> 02:22:05,239
Orhan and Alaeddin.

1584
02:22:05,680 --> 02:22:09,239
They're going to save them
from that castle tomorrow.

1585
02:22:10,400 --> 02:22:11,999
Bayhan Bey.

1586
02:22:12,000 --> 02:22:14,519
You'll do as the infidels want.

1587
02:22:14,600 --> 02:22:18,079
You will tell them about our plans but...

1588
02:22:18,080 --> 02:22:20,479
...you'll give them as much
information as we want.

1589
02:22:23,120 --> 02:22:26,879
Bayhan Bey told you...

1590
02:22:27,600 --> 02:22:31,279
...only the parts I wanted you to know.

1591
02:22:34,080 --> 02:22:39,599
I'll kill you with your son, Bayhan.

1592
02:22:52,600 --> 02:22:54,639
Damn it.

1593
02:22:55,960 --> 02:22:58,799
We are trapped here, Lukas.

1594
02:23:03,520 --> 02:23:05,279
Wait there.

1595
02:23:05,920 --> 02:23:07,679
Wait there.

1596
02:23:08,280 --> 02:23:11,319
Alps!

1597
02:23:14,080 --> 02:23:16,919
Closed the gates.

1598
02:23:18,720 --> 02:23:24,079
Everyone will see what happens to those
setting their eyes on the lands of Turks.

1599
02:23:28,280 --> 02:23:33,239
You'll taste this sharpened sword.

1600
02:23:39,120 --> 02:23:40,439
